<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha mwanduso cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha mwanduso cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="iot">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli baho mwanduso vilumbilizigwa kuwa chitabu chimwe chochitangigwe Samweli. Vitabu va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vosimulila ugima wa mulotezi Samweli na mfalume Sauli na mfalume Daudi. Samweli kakala mulangulizi wa uhelelo lusita isi ya Isilaili viikalile yolangulizigwa na Wasemi. Samweli iyo yawahakile mavuta Sauli na Daudi kuwa wafalume wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Habule munhu yavimanyile yelihi yandikile vitabu vino va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli. Munhu yandikile hatambule zina jake mwenyewo muna ivitabu ivo, mbali yodahika kakala mgima lusita lwose lwa utawala wa mfalume Daudi, hebu yodahika kakala mgima mbaka viumalile utawala uwo. Kakala na udahi wa kulola na kusoma maandiko yamwenga yosimulila ugima wa Sauli na Samweli. Kwaviya hachivimanyile yelihi yandikile vitabu vino, lelo hachivimanya kuwa vitabu vino vandikigwa zuwaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka ya 3 zolonga kusonhela kwelekigwa na kutangigwa na Mulungu kwa mulotezi Samweli muna usang'hano wake.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sula ya 4 mbaka sula ya 7 zofambula viya Wafilisiti viwasolile sanduku da lagano da Mulungu kulawa kwa Waisilaili na viya vidigalile magayo muna yamabululu ya Wafilisiti lusita vidikalile muna yamabululu yawo.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 8 mbaka sula ya 15 zofambula viya Waisilaili viwalondile kuwa na mfalume, iviya Samweli viyamuhakile mavuta Sauli kuwa mfalume wawo wa mwanduso, iviya Mulungu viyamulemile Sauli baho hamwande.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Muna isula ya 16 mbaka sula ya 31 chosoma viya Samweli viyamuhakile mavuta Daudi yawe mfalume wa Isilaili na viya Sauli viyaiyohile kumsepa Daudi yamkome.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekigwa kwa Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Kukala na munhu imwe yolawa Lama muna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu, zina jake katangigwa Elikana kulawa kabila da Efulaimu lukolo lwa Sufu. Wasaho yake Sufu kamweleka Tohu na Tohu kamweleka Elihu na Elihu kamweleka Yelohamu yeli tati yake Elikana. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana kakala na wake waidi. Imwe katangigwa Hana na imwenga katangigwa Penina. Penina kakala na wana, mbali Hana hakalile na wana.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Chila mwaka Elikana kakala yolawa muna dibululu jake kuhita kutambika na kumulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi uko Shilo. Hofini na Finehasi, wana wa Eli wakalile wakulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu, wakala uko.<verse eid="1SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Siku iyo Elikana viyahitile kulava nhambiko, kamwing'ha unde Penina muke wake. Iviya kaweng'ha wanage wose wa chilume na wa chike unde dimwedimwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Mbali kamwing'ha Hana maunde maidi kwaviya kanogelwa nayo, ingawa Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda yawe mgumba. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Mbali Penina komsovulaga ng'hani Hana muladi kumtenda yawone usungu, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda yawe mgumba. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Mbuli iyo itendeka chila mwaka. Hana viyahitile kuna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu, muke miyage kamsovula. Ivo Hana kalila na kalema kuja. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana mulumake kamuuza, “Hana, habali kolila? Habali kolema kuja? Habali kuna usungu? Niye nokugesa ng'hani kufosa viya wahakugesile wanago wa chilume hata one wahawile longo.”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Viwakomeleze kuja na kung'wa uko Shilo, Hana kenuka na kahita kupula. Uko mkulu wa nhambiko Eli kakala yakalile muna ichigoda chake habehi na hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana kakala na usungu ng'hani muna umoyo wake, kampula Mndewa Mulungu na kalila ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Hana kailaha, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu Uli na Udahi, uhalola magayo yangu msang'hani wako na kunikumbuka, sekeunizimize niye msang'hani wako. One uhaning'ha mwana wa chilume, mwana iyo nizamtula kumwako weye Mndewa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wake na hezaweguligwa ditwi jake.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana kagendelela kumpula Mndewa Mulungu, Eli kamulola mulomo wake. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana kakala kopula muna umoyo wake, mulomo wake ukala wogudemeka, mbali dizi jake hadihulikike. Eli kagesa kakala yakoligwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Ivo Eli kamulongela, “Vino kwizakung'wa upele mbaka zuwaki? Leka kung'wa upele!”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana kamwidika, “Siivo bule mwenevale wangu, kwaviya niye ni muke yeli na magayo makulu. Sing'wile upele hebu chinhu chochose chikola, mbali niulava muhe wangu kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Nigaya ng'hani na kulongelela kwa Mndewa Mulungu mbaka sambi, ivo sekeugese kuwa niye msang'hani wako ni mwanamke hafaya chinhu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli kamwidika, “Hita kwa tindiwalo, Mulungu wa Isilaili yakwing'he chiya chiumpulile.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana kalonga, “Niye msang'hani wako nitogoligwe na weye.” Mwanamke iyo kasegela, kaja ndiya na hawile na usungu kaidi.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Igolo yake imitondo Elikana na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake waidawa na wamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu, maabaho wahita ukaye yawo uko Lama. Elikana kambandama Hana muke wake na Mndewa Mulungu kamkumbuka muke iyo. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ivo Hana kapata wimo na keleka mwana wa chilume mwanduso wa mwaka, kamtanga zina jake Samweli. Kalonga, “Nimpula kwa Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana komulava Samweli kwa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elikana na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake wahita Shilo kaidi kumulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya chila mwaka na kufikiza chilaho chake, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />mbali Hana hahitile. Kamulongela mulumake, “Mwanangu yahaleka tombo nizamtula kwa Mndewa Mulungu na kezakala uko siku zose.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana kamwidika, “Tenda vovose vouwona vofaya. Kala hakaye mbaka vondaumulekeze imwana kong'ha. Mndewa Mulungu yafikize mbuli yake muhala.” Ivo Hana kasigala ukaye na kamong'heza mwanage mbaka viyamulekeze tombo.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Viyamulekeze tombo, kamsola imwana hamwe na ng'ombe lume da miyaka mitatu na chilo longo za usage na chiya cha divai, kamgala imwana muna dihema da Mndewa Mulungu uko Shilo, ija imwana kakala mdodo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Viwakomeleze kumchinja ng'ombe iyo, wamgala imwana kwa Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana kamulongela Eli, “Weye mwenevale wangu, kweli niye niiyo muke nimile habehi yako nompula Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nipula ning'higwe mwana ino. Mndewa Mulungu kaning'ha chiya chinimpulile. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Lelo nomtula mwana ino kwa Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kezamsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wake.” Maabaho kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu hanhu haja.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hana kopula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Hana kapula na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Moyo wangu womdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">nihuma kwa kutazigwa na Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nowaseka wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">kwaviya noudeng'helela ukombola wako.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Habule yelile fana Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kwaviya habule imwenga ila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">habule luwe lulingile fana Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />“Sekemulonge kwa udugi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">magoda sekeyalawe muna imilomo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kovimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">kohumiza sang'hano zose.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Mhinde za wanhu weli na nguvu zibeneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">mbali weli wanyondenyonde wogendelela kuwa na nguvu.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Waja wakalile na ndiya nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambi wolondeka wasang'hane kupata ndiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mbali wakalile na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambi weguta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mwanamke yakalile mgumba kapata wana saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">mbali mwanamke yeli na wana wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">kalekigwa bila mwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />“Mndewa Mulungu kokoma na kubweleza ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">kowahulumusa wanhu kuzimu, maabaho kowakweza.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Mndewa Mulungu komtenda munhu yawe ngayengaye na komtenda munhu yawe na vinhu vingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Kowahulumusa weli na vinhu vingi na kowakweza ngayengaye.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Komwinula ngayengaye kulawa muna yamatimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">komkweza yolonda vinhu kulawa muna dizalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">muladi yaweke hamwe na wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">wakachihazi chigoda cha chifalume cha utunhizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Chila chinhu chilumbigwa na Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">nayo kachika chila chinhu hanhu hake.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Kezaikaliza migulu ya wanhu wake wokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">mbali wanhu wehi wezakwikigwa muna diziza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Habule munhu yondayahume kwa nguvu muhala.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Wehi wa Mndewa Mulungu wezadanganizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">kezawagalila ng'huwa kulawa kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Mndewa Mulungu kezazitagusa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Nayo kezamwing'ha nguvu mfalume wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">na kezamtenda yahume munhu wake iyamsagule kwa sang'hano yelile.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Maabaho Elikana kabwela ukaye yake uko Lama, mbali imwana Samweli kasigala uko na kumsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulangulizi wa mkulu wa nhambiko Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wihi wa wana wa chilume wa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Wana wa chilume wa Eli wakala hawafaya ng'hani, hawamtegeleze Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Chihendo cha wakulu wa nhambiko lusita ulo kwa wanhu ikala, munhu yoyose yahalava nhambiko ya kutimbula, msang'hani wa mkulu wa nhambiko kokwiza na uma uli na meno matatu kuno nyama yokimula. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Nayo kowingiza uma uwo muna inongo hebu vugwa hebu lukalango hebu muna ichia, nyama yoyose inuligwe kwa uma uwo kamwing'ha mkulu wa nhambiko. Vino niivo viwatendile Waisilaili wose wezile uko Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Kaidi ing'hali kutimbula mavuta, kokwiza msang'hani wa mkulu wa nhambiko, komulongela ija yolava nhambiko, “Ning'he nyama mbisi nimgalile mkulu wa nhambiko yakabanike, kwaviya kolema kwing'higwa nyama ikimusigwe.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />One munhu yahamulongela, “Mabambala yatimbuligwe teng'hu, maabaho usole chochose choulonda.” Mbali msang'hani kezakwidika, “Bule, ning'he sambi, one hulonda nizaisola kwa nguvu.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Uhasanyi wa wabwanga wa Eli ukala mkulu ng'hani haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya waizeha nhosa ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana komulaula Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Mbwanga Samweli kamsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu kuno kayawala chizibawo cha chitani. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Chila mwaka mami yake kamsonela ng'hanzu ndodo na kumgalila viyahitile hamwe na mulumake kulava nhambiko ya chila mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli kamtemela mate Elikana na muke wake, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu yakwing'he wana kwa mwanamke ino, wasole hanhu ha ija youmtulile kwa Mndewa Mulungu.” Maabaho wabwela ukaye yawo. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuwonela ubazi Hana, nayo kapata wana wamwenga wa chilume watatu na wa chike waidi. Mbwanga Samweli kagendelela kukula haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli kowazuma wanage wa chilume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Eli kakala mulala ng'hani. Kahulika mbuli zose wanage ziwawatendele Waisilaili wose na hata viya viwawabandame wanaake wowasang'hane usang'hano hana ihanhu ha kwingilila hana dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ivo kawalongela, “Habali motenda mbuli zino? Nihulika sang'hano zenu zihile kulawa kwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Siivo bule wanangu! Kwaviya mbuli ino hainogile, yoniihulika yopwililika mwa wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />One munhu imwe yahamuhasanya miyage, munhu imwenga kodaha kumpulila kwa Mulungu, nayo Mulungu kodaha kumgombela, mbali one munhu yahamuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu, yelihi yondayampulile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Mbali iwana hawamtegeleze tati yawo, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kailungila kuwakoma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Mbwanga Samweli kagendelela kukula na kamnogeza Mndewa Mulungu na wanhu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi kusonhela kaye ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Siku dimwe mulotezi wa Mulungu kamwizila Eli, kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Vino niye silawilile muna ikaye ya tati yako lusita viwakalile watumwa uko Misili kwa mfalume wa Misili? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Kulawa muna yamakabila yose ya Isilaili niwasagula wasaho zako muladi wawe wakulu wa nhambiko wangu, wasang'hane muna ulupango, kusoma ubani na kuvala chizibawo haulongozi hangu. Iviya niweng'ha wasaho zako hanhu ha nhambiko za Waisilaili zozitimbuligwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Habali kozeha nhambiko na nhosa zonizilagilize muna ikaye yangu? Habali kuwahishimu wanago kufosa niye na kuineneheza kwa nhambiko zose zinogile za wanhu wangu wa Isilaili?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Ivo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kolonga, ‘Kweli, nilonga kuwa kaye yako na kaye ya wasaho yako wezanisang'hanila siku zose.’ Mbali sambi Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Mbuli ino haidahika, kwaviya waja wonihishimu nizawahishimu, waja wonizeha nizawalema. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Lusita lokwiza vondanikukome weye na chila munhu muna ulukolo lwako. Habule munhu yondayafike kuulala. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Kwizayawona magayo muna ikaye yangu. Waisilaili wezakwing'higwa vinhu vingi, mbali muna ulukolo lwako hakwizakuwa na munhu yondayafike kuulala siku zose. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />One nihamuleka munhu yoyose muna ulukolo lwako kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko, kezatulika yameso na kezakuwa na usungu. Mbali walume wose muna ulukolo lwako wezadanganika vihile.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />“ ‘Chondachiwalawilile wanago wa chilume waidi, Hofini na Finehasi, chizakuwa chilaguso kumwako. Wose waidi wezadanganika siku dimwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Nizamsagula mkulu wa nhambiko yonitegeleza na kutenda chila chinhu chonilonda kutenda. Nizamwing'ha nyelesi zisang'hane siku zose haulongozi wa munhu wangu yonimsagule kuwa mfalume. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Maabaho chila munhu yondayasigale muna ulukolo lwako, kezahita kumtumbalila mavindi mkulu wa nhambiko iyo na kumulongela, “Nokulamba unigume muna usang'hano wako wa ukulu wa nhambiko muladi nipate kuja chihande chidogo cha gate.” ’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu komtanga Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Mbwanga Samweli kamsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu kwa kumtaza mkulu wa nhambiko Eli. Siku izo mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu ikala haipatika ng'hani, kukala kwabule magubulo mengi.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Siku dimwe Eli viyakalile kagona hanhu hake, meso yake yakala hayalola goya. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Chitasa cha Mulungu chikala chokwaka, iviya Samweli kakala yagonile muna dihema da Mndewa Mulungu hanhu hadikalile sanduku da lagano. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga Samweli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Samweli kamwidika, “Nahano!”<verse eid="1SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Kakimbila kuhita kwa Eli, kalonga, “Nahano. Kunitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Eli kamulongela, “Sikutangile, bwela ukagone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Samweli kabwela kugona.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga Samweli kaidi. Samweli kalamka kahita kwa Eli, kalonga, “Nahano. Kunitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Eli kamulongela, “Mwanangu, sikutangile bule, bwela ukagone kaidi.”<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli kakala yang'hali hanammanya Mndewa Mulungu. Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu ikala hainagubuligwa kumwake.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga Samweli mwanza weketatu, Samweli kenuka na kahita kwa Eli, kalonga, “Nahano. Kunitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Maabaho Eli kavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu iyo yakalile yomtanga imbwanga iyo. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ivo Eli kamulongela Samweli, “Hita ukagone, one yahakutanga kaidi, mulongele, ‘Longa, Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya msang'hani wako kotegeleza.’ ” Ivo Samweli kabwela kugona hanhu hake.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Mndewa Mulungu keza, kema hajahaja na kamtanga kaidi fana viyatendile ichanduso, “Samweli! Samweli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samweli kamwidika, “Longa, kwaviya msang'hani wako kotegeleza.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Uteganye, nizatenda chinhu muna iisi ya Isilaili, chila munhu yondayahulike kezasinhuka. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Siku iyo nizafikiza chila chinhu chinilongile kusonhela kaye ya Eli. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Kwaviya nimulongela kuwa nizautagusa welesi wake siku zose, kwa ichimu cha wihi uja uyaumanyile, kwaviya wanage waniliga na yeye hawagomese. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ivo niilaha kwa welesi wa Eli kuwa ubananzi uwatendile hawizasafyigwa kwa nhambiko hebu kwa nhosa siku zose.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli kagona mbaka imitotondo, maabaho kavugula lwivi lwa hema da Mndewa Mulungu. Kadumba kumulongela Eli magubulo yayo, <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />mbali Eli kamtanga na kamulongela, “Samweli mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samweli kamwidika, “Nabaha.”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli kamuuza, “Mulungu kakulongela choni? Sekeunifise. Mulungu yakutaguse one hunilongele chiya chiyakulongele.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ivo Samweli kamulongela chila chinhu na hamfisile chinhu chochose. Maabaho Eli kalonga, “Iyo Mndewa Mulungu, muleke yatende chiyowona chinoga.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samweli kakula, Mndewa Mulungu kamtaza na katenda chila chinhu chiyalongile Samweli chiwe kweli. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Waisilaili wose, kwandusila isi ya Dani ili ubanzi wa kasikazi mbaka Belisheba ili ubanzi wa kusi wavimanya kuwa Samweli kakala mulotezi yokwaminika wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kagendelela kumulawilila Samweli uko Shilo na kamulongela cha kulonga.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisiti wodisola sanduku da lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Samweli kawalongela mbuli ya Mulungu Waisilaili wose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Ivo Waisilaili wahita kuitowa ng'hondo na Wafilisiti. Waisilaili weka lago jawo uko Ebenezeli na Wafilisiti weka lago jawo uko Afeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Wafilisiti waisasala kuwatowa Waisilaili na viwaitowile, Waisilaili wahumigwa na Wafilisiti. Waisilaili wakomigwe wakala 4,000. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Watowang'hondo wa Waisilaili wabwela kuna dilago jawo, walangulizi walonga, “Habali Mndewa Mulungu kachileka chihumigwe na Wafilisiti diyelo? Chihite chikadisole sanduku da lagano kulawa Shilo chidigale kuno, dize hagati yetu na kuchikombola muna yamakono ya wehi wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ivo wawatuma wanhu wahite Shilo, nawo wadigala sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, yokala hagati ya makelubi uchanyha ya sanduku da lagano. Hofini na Finehasi, wana waidi wa Eli, wakala uko hamwe na sanduku ijo da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu vidingile muna dilago, Waisilaili wose waguta kwa deng'ho mbaka isi igudemeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wafilisiti viwahulike woguta, walonga, “Nyangi zino zose za choni muna dilago da Waebulaniya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Viwavimanyile kuwa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu dingila muna dilago da Waisilaili, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Wafilisiti wadumba kwaviya walonga, “Mulungu keza muna dilago, chizagaya! Mbuli ilingile vino hainalawilila. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Chizagaya! Yelihi yodaha kuchikombola kulawa muna yamakono ya milungu ino ili na nguvu? Iyo ni milungu iwatowile Wamisili kwa hulo uko kuchuwala! <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Wafilisiti gangamaleni! Tendeni chilume, sekemuwe watumwa wa Waebulaniya fana wawo viwakalile watumwa wenu. Tendeni chilume mukaitowe nawo.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Ivo Wafilisiti waitowa nawo, Waisilaili watowigwa na chila munhu kakimbilila ukaye yake. Waisilaili wakomigwa wengi ng'hani, wakomigwa watowang'hondo 30,000 wogenda kwa migulu. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Sanduku da lagano da Mulungu disoligwa, nawo wana wa chilume waidi wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi wakomigwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Siku iyoiyo munhu kulawa kabila da Benyamini kakimbila kulawa kuna ing'hondo mbaka kafika Shilo. Viwalo vake videgeka na kakala na timbwisi muna iditwi jake kulagusa kuwa kana usungu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Viyafikile, Eli kakala muna ichigoda chake mumgwazo wa nzila kogozela, kwaviya moyo wake udidumba sanduku da lagano da Mulungu. Munhu ija viyengile muna dibululu kalonga mbuli iyo na wanhu wa bululu jose waguta. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli viyahulike nyangi, kauza, “Nyangi izo fambulo jake choni?” Munhu ija kahita kwa Eli kumulongela. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Eli kakala na miyaka malongo kenda na minane, meso yake yatulika, hadahile kuwona. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Munhu ija kamulongela Eli, “Niye nilawa kuna ing'hondo, nikimbila kulawa kuna ing'hondo diyelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli kamuuza, “Mwanangu, uko kulawilila choni?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Munhu ija kamwidika, “Waisilaili wawakimbila Wafilisiti na wakomigwa wanhu wengi ng'hani! Wanago waidi Hofini na Finehasi iviya wadanganika na sanduku da lagano da Mulungu disoligwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Munhu ija viyaditambule sanduku da lagano da Mulungu, Eli kagwa chingalingali kulawa muna ichigoda chake hamgwazo ya lwivi lukulu lwa bululu. Kabeneka isingo na kadanganika, kwaviya kakala mulala na kazama. Kakala mulangulizi wa Waisilaili miyaka malongo mane.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Mkoi wake yeli muke wa Finehasi kakala na wimo na kakala habehi na kuibasula. Viyahulike kuwa sanduku da lagano da Mulungu dihokigwa na kuwa mkoi wake na mulumake wadanganika, kahita kwa mulala kuibasula kwaviya kapata usungu. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Viyakalile habehi kudanganika, wanaake wakalile womtaza wamulongela, “Sekeudumbe, kwaviya kuvumbula mwana wa chilume.” Mbali hawedike na hawategeleze. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Kamwing'ha zina imwana Ikabodi, kalonga, “Utunhizo usegela Isilaili,” kwaviya sanduku da lagano da Mulungu disoligwa na kwa ichimu cha ifa ya mkoi wake na mulumake. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Kalonga, “Ukulu usegela Isilaili, kwaviya sanduku da lagano da Mulungu dihokigwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisiti na sanduku da lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Wafilisiti viwadisolile sanduku da lagano da Mulungu, wadisola kulawa lago da Ebenezeli mbaka bululu da Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Maabaho wadingiza muna ikaye ya Dagoni mulungu wawo na wadika habehi na nyang'hiti ya Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Wanhu wa Ashidodi viwalamkile imitondo, nyang'hiti ya mulungu Dagoni igwa hasi chingubingubi haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo wainula nyang'hiti iyo na waika hanhu hake kaidi. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Igolo yake imitondo viwalamkile, nyang'hiti iyo igwa hasi chingubingubi haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu. Ditwi jake na makono yake yose maidi yakanhika visigala hana ichizingiti, nyang'hiti ya Dagoni isigala dibungubungu muhala. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Lekamana wakulu wa nhambiko wa Dagoni na wanhu wose wokwingila muna ikaye ya Dagoni hawabojoga ichizingiti uko Ashidodi mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kawagaza wanhu wa Ashidodi na vibululu vili habehi, kawananga na kuwagaza kwa maihu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Wanhu wa Ashidodi viwawone mbuli izo zilawilila, walonga, “Sanduku da lagano da Mulungu wa Isilaili sekedikale hano na cheye, kwaviya kachigaza cheye na mulungu wetu Dagoni.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ivo wawatanga hamwe walangulizi wose wa Wafilisiti na wawauza, “Chiditende choni sanduku da lagano da Mulungu wa Isilaili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Wawo wamwidika, “Sanduku da lagano da Mulungu wa Isilaili dihamizigwe dihite Gasi.” Ivo wadihamiza sanduku ijo. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Viwadihamize, Mndewa Mulungu kawagaza wanhu wa bululu ijo na kawadumbiza ng'hani, kawatowa wadododo na wakulu kwa kuweng'ha maihu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ivo wadigala sanduku da lagano mbaka Ekiloni. Sanduku da lagano da Mulungu vidifikile Ekiloni, wanhu wa Ekiloni waguta, walonga, “Wadigala sanduku da lagano da Mulungu wa Isilaili kumwetu kuchikoma cheye na wanhu wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ivo wawatanga hamwe walangulizi wose wa Wafilisiti na wawalongela, “Disegezeni sanduku da lagano da Mulungu wa Isilaili, dibwelezeni hanhu hake muladi sekedichikome cheye na wanhu wetu.” Wanhu wa bululu jose wadumba kudanganika kwaviya Mulungu kawagaza. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Waja hawadanganike wagazigwa na maihu na waipula milungu yawo iwataze.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku da lagano dobwelezigwa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu vidikalile kuna iisi ya Wafilisiti kwa miyezi saba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Wafilisiti wawatanga wakulu wa nhambiko wa Dagoni na walaguzi, wawalongela, “Chiditendeze sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu? Chilongeleni chidibweleze hanhu hake na chinhu chilihi?”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Wamwidika, “One mwahadibweleza sanduku ijo da Mulungu wa Isilaili, sekemudibweleze bila chinhu, mbali mumgalile nhambiko za ubananzi, ivo mwizahona. Iviya mwizavimanya chimu chimtendile Mulungu yamgazeni.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Wafilisiti wauza, “Chimgalile choni chiwe nhambiko ya ubananzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Wawedika, “Maihu ya zahabu matano na ngoso wa zahabu watano, ihu dimwe na ngoso imwe kwa chila mulangulizi Mfilisiti, kwaviya mahulo yampatani mweye na walangulizi wenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Ivo mwizatenda nyang'hiti za maihu yenu na nyang'hiti za ngoso wenu woibananga isi, muladi mweye mumtogoze Mulungu wa Isilaili. Yodahika kezamuhunguzilani magayo mweye na milungu yenu na isi yenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Habali moitenda mizoyo yenu kuwa midala fana viwatendile Wamisili na mfalume wa Misili? Mulungu viyawatendele Wamisili kwa kukalika, Wamisili walondeka wawaleke Waisilaili wasegele, kweli wasegela. <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Lelo itendeleni tololi da sambi, soleni na ng'ombe waidi wokamigwa weli hawanafungigwa nila mukawafunge muna ditololi na kuyasegeza madang'ang'a yawo na kuyaguma muna dibumba. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Soleni sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu mudike muna ditololi, vinhu va zahabu vondamumgalile kuwa nhambiko zenu za ubananzi muvike muna disanduku dimwenga hamgwazo yake. Maabaho dilekeni ditololi dihite. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Maabaho muulole, one uhahita muna inzila ya kuhita kuna iisi ya Isilaili bululu da Besi Shemesi, chizavimanya Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yachigalile magayo. Mbali one hauhita, chizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu hachigalile magayo mbali chipatigwa na setani.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Watenda fana viwalongeligwe. Wasola ng'ombe waidi wokong'heza na wawafunga muna ditololi, madang'ang'a yawo wayafunga muna dibumba. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Wadika sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu muna ditololi, hamwe na sanduku dili na nyang'hiti za ngoso wa zahabu na nyang'hiti za maihu ya zahabu. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ng'ombe wawo wahita dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka Besi Shemeshi, wasondelela inzila kuno wolila, mbali hawabaguke kulume hebu kumoso. Walangulizi wa Wafilisiti wawasondelela mbaka wafika kuna imhaka ya Besi Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Wanhu wa Besi Shemeshi wakala wohuna ngano yawo kudibawe, viwalolile na kuwona sanduku da lagano, wadeng'helela. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Tololi diya dingila muna umgunda wa Yoshua wa Besi Shemeshi na wima habehi na luwe lukulu. Wanhu watula imibiki ya ditololi na wawalava ng'ombe waja kuwa nhambiko ya kutimbula kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Walawi wadihumulusa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu, hamwe na diya disanduku dimwenga dikalile na vinhu va zahabu, wavika uchanyha ya luwe lukulu, wanhu wa Besi Shemeshi walava nhambiko za kutimbula na kuchinja nhambiko siku iyo iyo kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Walangulizi watano wa Wafilisiti viwawonile mbuli iyo, wabwela Ekiloni siku iyo iyo.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Zino izo nyang'hiti za maihu ya zahabu zowagalile Wafilisiti ziwe nhambiko za ubananzi kwa Mndewa Mulungu, ihu dimwe kwa chila bululu, Ashidodi na Gaza na Ashikeloni na Gasi na Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Iviya wagala ngoso wa zahabu kwa kusondelela mabululu yose ya Wafilisiti yaja yalangulizigwe na wafalume watano, mabululu yeli na mhongono na vibululu. Luwe luja lowekile sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu uchanyha yake, lwauko mbaka diyelo kuna umgunda wa Yoshua wa Besi Shemesi fana ukalangama kwa mbuli ziya zilawilile.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kawakoma walume wamwenga malongo saba wa Besi Shemesi kwaviya wasungulila muna disanduku da lagano. Wanhu waomboleza kwa ichimu cha hulo kulu kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanduku da lagano uko Kiliasi Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ivo wanhu wa Besi Shemeshi walonga, “Yelihi yodaha kwima haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu ino yelile? Kulawa hano sanduku da lagano dizahita kwa yelihi?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Wawatuma wasenga kwa wanhu wa Kiliasi Yealimu wakalonge, “Wafilisiti wadibweleza sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu. Izoni mudisole.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Ivo wanhu wa Kiliasi Yealimu weza na kudisola sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu, wadigala kuna ikaye ya Abinadabu kuna umulima. Wamwika hakwe Eleazali mwanage muladi yadikalize sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli kokuwa msemi wa Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu dikala Kiliasi Yealimu kwa miyaka malongo maidi, lusita ulwo Waisilaili wose wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu yawataze.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samweli kawalongela Waisilaili wose, “One muhambwelela Mndewa Mulungu kwa mizoyo yenu yose, muleke milungu yenu ya chigeni na Maashitalosi, mumsasalile Mndewa Mulungu mizoyo yenu. Mumsang'hanile yeye muhala, nayo kezamkombolani muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ivo Waisilaili wasegeza Mabaali na Maashitalosi, wamsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu muhala.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Maabaho Samweli kalonga, “Waduganyeni hamwe Waisilaili wose uko Misipa, niye nizampulilani kwa Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ivo wose waiting'hana hamwe uko Misipa. Wadeha mazi na kuyetila kuwa nhambiko kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Siku ija wafunga kuja na walonga, “Chimuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu.” Samweli kakala msemi wa Waisilaili uko Misipa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Wafilisiti viwahulike kuwa Waisilaili waiting'hana hamwe uko Misipa, walangulizi wa Wafilisiti weza kuitowa nawo. Waisilaili viwahulike ivo wawadumba Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Wamulongela Samweli, “Sekeuleke kumulamba Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, kwa ichimu chetu, muladi yachilopole muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Samweli kasola mwanang'hondolo yokong'ha, kamulava wose kuwa nhambiko ya kutimbula kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Samweli kamulamba Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili, Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samweli viyakalile kolava nhambiko ya kutimbula, Wafilisiti wakwenhuka habehi muladi kuitowa na Waisilaili. Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kagala mbumo mkulu ng'hani kwa Wafilisiti siku iyo na kawadumbiza, nawo wakimbila kuno Waisilaili wowawona. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Waisilaili walawa Misipa, wawawinga na wawakoma Wafilisiti muna inzila mbaka viwafikile habehi na Besi Kali.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Maabaho Samweli kasola dibwe na kadisimika hagati ya Misipa na Sheni, kaditanga Ebenezeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ebenezeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake “dibwe ditaza.”</char></note> na kalonga, “Mbaka sambi Mndewa Mulungu kachitaza.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ivo Wafilisiti wahumigwa na hawengile kaidi muna iisi ya Waisilaili. Mndewa Mulungu kawagaza Wafilisiti siku zose za ugima wa Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Mabululu yose Wafilisiti yowawahokile Waisilaili yabwelezigwa kwa Waisilaili, kwandusila Ekiloni mbaka Gasi. Waisilaili waikombola isi yawo kulawa kwa Wafilisiti. Iviya kuwa na tindiwalo hagati ya Waisilaili na Waamoli.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samweli kagendelela kuwa msemi wa Waisilaili siku zose za ugima wake. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Chila mwaka kahita kuzunguluka uko Beseli na Giligali na Misipa, kawahumiza Waisilaili hanhu baho hose. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Maabaho kabwelaga Lama koikalile kaye yake, uko kawahumiza Waisilaili. Uko kamzengela lupango Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wolonda mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samweli viyawile mulala, kawatenda wanage wawe wasemi wa isi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwanage wa udele katangigwa Yoeli na mwanage wekaidi katangigwa Abiya, wawo wakala wasemi uko Belisheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Mbali wanage hawatendile fana viyatendile tati yawo, watenda ivo muladi wapate faida. Wahokela limangwe na wahumiza havilondeka.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ivo walangulizi wose wa Isilaili waiting'hana hamwe na wahita uko Lama kwa Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Wamulongela, “Lola, weye kulala na wanago hawatenda fana viutendile weye. Chisagulile mfalume yachilangulize fana zisi zose zimwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Mbali mbuli iyo imwihila Samweli, viwalongile, “Ching'he mfalume yachilangulize.” Samweli kampula Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Tegeleza chila chinhu chowokulongela wanhu, kwaviya hawakulemile weye, mbali wanilema niye sekeniwe mfalume wawo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Fana viya viwatendile kwandusila siku ija viniwalavile muna iisi ya Misili mbaka diyelo, wanileka na kutambikila milungu imwenga. Sambi wokutendela weye. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Lelo wategeleze, mbali uwazume na uwalongele viya mfalume vondayawalangulize.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Samweli kawalongela mbuli zose za Mndewa Mulungu wanhu walondile mfalume. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Kawalongela, “Vino niivo vondayatende mfalume yondayamulangulizeni. Kezawasola wanenu wa chilume na kuwatenda wasang'hani muna yamatololi yake yobululigwa na falasi na kuwa wakwelafalasi na kudilongolela tololi jake da kubululigwa na falasi. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Wamwenga kezawatenda wawe wemilizi wa watowang'hondo maelufu na wamwenga wemilizi wa watowang'hondo malongo matano. Wanenu wa chilume wezalima mgunda wake na kugobola mavuno yake, iviya wezamtendela vinhu vake va ng'hondo na va matololi yake ya kubululigwa na falasi. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Kezawatenda wandele wenu kuwa wengaji wa mavuta yonung'ha goya na wambikaji na wokaji wa magate. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Kezasola migunda yenu inogile, migunda ya mizabibu na migunda ya mizaituni, muladi yaweng'he wasang'hani wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Iviya kezasola chibugulu chimwe chila muna vibugulu longo va mavuno yenu ya mizabibu na ya mhule, muladi yaweng'he wakulu wake na wasang'hani wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Mfalume kezasola wasang'hani wenu wa chilume na wachike na wabwanga wenu wanogile na vihongwe wenu na kuwatenda wamsang'hanile. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Kezasola mnyama imwe chila muna iwanyama wenu. Mweye wenyewo mwizakuwa watumwa wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Lusita ulo mwizamulamba Mulungu kwa ichimu cha mfalume wenu imumsagule wenyewo, mbali Mndewa Mulungu hezamwidikani siku iyo.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Mbali wanhu walema kumtegeleza Samweli, walonga, “Aka! Cholonda mfalume wa kuchilanguliza, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />muladi chiwe fana zisi zimwenga zose, chiwe na mfalume wa kuchilanguliza na kuchilongolela kuna ing'hondo na kuchigombela.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samweli viyahulike mbuli zose ziwalongile wanhu, kabwela kuzilonga kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Wategeleze na uweng'he mfalume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Maabaho Samweli kawalongela wanhu wa Isilaili, “Chila munhu yabwele kuna dibululu jake.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kosaguligwa kuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Kukala na munhu imwe wa kabila da Benyamini, zina jake Kishi, mwana wa Abieli, mwana wa Seloli, mwana wa Bekolasi, mwana wa Afiya, yeli galu na yeli na nguvu. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Nayo kakala na mwana wa chilume zina jake Sauli, mwa Waisilaili wose hakukalile na munhu yanogile fana yeye, kakala mtali kufosa wanhu wose.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Vihongwe wamwenga wa Kishi, tati yake Sauli wakala wagile. Kishi kamulongela Sauli mwanage, “Sola msang'hani imwe uhite nayo ukazahile vihongwe.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Wahita kwa kufosela isi ya vilima va Efulaimu na isi ya Shalisha, mbali hawawapatile. Ivo wahita kufosela isi ya Shaalimu, mbali vihongwe hawakalile uko. Maabaho wafosela isi ya Benyamini, mbali hawawapatile. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Viwafikile muna iisi ya Sufu, Sauli kamulongela ija imsang'hani iyahitile nayo, “Chibwele ukaye, buleivo tata kezaleka kugesa chihongwe na kezachigesa cheye.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Mbali msang'hani ija kamwidika, “Muna dibululu dino muna mulotezi wa Mulungu, kohishimika ng'hani na chila chinhu chiyolonga chokuwa kweli. Chihite kumwake sambi yodahika kezachilongela nzila ya kusondelela.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli kamulongela msang'hani wake, “Chihahita kumwake chizamwing'ha choni? Mana ndiya muna imikoba imala na chabule chinhu cha kumgalila mulotezi wa Mulungu, chizamwing'ha choni?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Msang'hani ija kamwidika, “Nina lobo ya shekeli ya hela muna yamakono yangu, nizamwing'ha msang'hani wa Mulungu shekeli iyo muladi yachitambulile nzila ya kusondelela.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Baho umwaka muna iisi ya Isilaili munhu viyahitile kuuza mbuli kwa Mulungu, kalonga, “Haya chiteni kwa mulolaji,” kwaviya munhu yotangigwa mulotezi sambi, baho umwaka katangigwa mulolaji. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli kamulongela msang'hani wake, “Kulonga goya, leka chihite!” Ivo wahita mbaka kuna dibululu diyakalile munhu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Viwafikile muna dibululu, waiting'hana na wandele wohita kudeha mazi, nawo wawauza wandele wawo, “Mulolaji kabaha?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Wawedika, “Kabaha, loleni kakuulongozi wenu, lopoleni, diyelo keza muna dibululu kwaviya wanhu wana nhambiko hanhu ha kutambikila. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Muhengila muna dibululu mwizamuwona hanakwela uchanyha kuja ndiya. Wanhu hawezakuja mbaka yeye yafike, kwaviya yeye niiyo yotemela mate nhambiko, maabaho wanhu wagonekigwe woja. Kweleni sambi mana lusita luno mwizamuwona.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ivo Sauli na msang'hani wake viwengile muna dibululu, wamuwona Samweli kolawa muna dibululu na kokwela hanhu ha kutambikila.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Siku dimwe ing'hali Sauli hanakwiza, Mndewa Mulungu kamgubulila Samweli, kamulongela, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Igolo lusita fana luno nizakugalila munhu kulawa kabila da Benyamini, weye kwizamuhaka mavuta muladi yawe mulangulizi wa Waisilaili, nayo kezawakombola wanhu wangu muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti. Niyawona magayo ya wanhu wangu na kulila kwawo kunifikila niye.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Igolo yake Samweli viyamuwonile Sauli, Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Ino iyo munhu inikulongele, kezawalanguliza wanhu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sauli kamkwenhukila Samweli hana ulwivi lwa bululu na kamuuza, “Nilongele kaye ya mulolaji yahalihi?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli kamwidika Sauli, “Niye iyo mulolaji, longola uhite hanhu ha kutambikila, kwaviya diyelo kwizakuja hamwe na niye. Maabaho imitondo nizakuleka usegele, nizakulongela chila chinhu chiugesa. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Sekeugaye, vihongwe waja wagile siku nhatu zifosile wawoneka. Vino yelihi Waisilaili iwomulonda ng'hani? Vino siyo weye na kaye ya tati yako?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli kamwidika, “Vino niye siyo wa kabila da Benyamini dili dodo kufosa makabila yose ya Isilaili? Vino wanhu wa lukolo lwangu siyo wadodo kufosa ng'holo za kabila da Benyamini? Lelo habali konilongela ivo?” <verse eid="1SA 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Maabaho Samweli kamulongoza Sauli na msang'hani wake mbaka kuna uluhelengo na kaweka hanhu ha hishima ng'hani howokala wanhu wagonikigwe, wakala wanhu malongo matatu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli kamulongela mwambikaji, “Nigalile unde da nyama donikwing'hile, diya donikulongele udike hakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Mwambikaji kasola nyama ya chima, kaika haulongozi wa Sauli. Samweli kalonga, “Ikigwe hakwe niiyo iyo! Ike haulongozi wako uje, kwaviya nyama iyo kwikiligwa weye mbaka lusita lulondeka, mana nilonga, ‘Niwagoneka wanhu.’ ” Ivo Sauli kaja hamwe na Samweli siku iyo. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Viwahumuluke kulawa hanhu ha kutambikila na kufika kuna dibululu, Samweli kalonga na Sauli uchanyha ya chisuwili chibadagale cha kaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli komuhaka mavuta Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Nawo walamuka chilochilo na Samweli kamtanga Sauli viyakalile uchanyha ya ichisuwili chibadagale, kalonga, “Isasale nikulage uhite kumwenu.” Ivo Sauli kaisasala, yeye na Samweli walawa hamwe. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Viwakalile wohumuluka kuuhelelo wa dibululu, Samweli kamulongela Sauli, “Mulongele msang'hani wako yalongole. Weye wime hano na niye chidogo, muladi nikulongele chiyanilongele Mulungu.” Msang'hani wake katenda ivo.<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Maabaho Samweli kasola nyhupa ya mavuta na kamgidila Sauli mditwi, maabaho kamnonela na kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kokuhaka mavuta uwe mulangulizi wa wanhu wake Waisilaili. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Vondausegele kumwangu diyelo, kwizaiting'hana na walume waidi habehi na leme da Laheli uko Selisa muna imhaka ya Benyamini, wezakulongela, ‘Vihongwe woukalile uwazahila wawoneka, tati yako kaleka kugesa mbuli ya vihongwe komgesani mweye, kolonga, “Nitendeze kumpata mwanangu?” ’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kulawa baho kwizagendelela mbaka uwone mbiki wa mwaloni uko Taboli. Kwizaiting'hana na wanhu watatu wohita kwa Mulungu uko Beseli, imwe kosola wanaluti watatu na imwenga kosola magate matatu na imwenga kosola chiya cha divai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Wezakulamusa na kukwing'ha magate maidi, weye kwizayahokela. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Maabaho kwizafika Gibea ya Mulungu, kuna imhongono ya Wafilisiti. Vondaufike muna dibululu kwizaiting'hana na bumbila da walotezi wohulumuka kulawa hanhu ha kutambikila, wana bango na ngoma na chilongelonge kuulongozi wawo, wezakuwa wolotela. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu wizakwizila kwa nguvu, kwizalotela hamwe nawo na wanhu hawezakumanya. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Vilaguso vino vihakulawilila, tenda chochose chouwona chinoga, kwaviya Mulungu kahamwe na weye. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Maabaho kwizahulumuka kuulongozi wangu mbaka Giligali, niye nizakuhulumukila uko muladi kulava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Kwizanigozela siku saba mbaka vondanize kukulongela vinhu voulondeka kutenda.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kotendigwa kuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli viyahinduke kumuleka Samweli, Mulungu kaugalusa moyo wa Sauli unoge. Chila chinhu chiyalongile Samweli chilawilila siku ija. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli na msang'hani wake viwafikile Gibea, bumbila da walotezi waiting'hana nawo, Muhe wa Mulungu umwizila kwa nguvu na kandusa kulotela hamwe nawo. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Wanhu wammanyile umwaka viwamuwone kolotela hamwe na walotezi, waiuzagiza, “Chino choni chimulawilile mwana wa Kishi? Sauli iviya imwe wa walotezi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Munhu yakalile baho kawauza, “Tati yawo yelihi?” Ivo kulawilila simwe dilonga, “Vino Sauli iviya imwe wa walotezi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli viyakomeleze kulotela, kahita hanhu ha kutambikila.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Tati yake mdodo Sauli kamuuza Sauli na msang'hani wake, “Mukala kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sauli kamwidika “Chikala chozahila vihongwe, mbali vichiwonile kuwa hachiwawona chihita kwa Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Tati yake mdodo Sauli kalonga, “Nilongele, Samweli kamulongelani choni?”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli kamwidika, “Kachilongela kuwa vihongwe wawoneka.” Mbali hamulongele tati yake mdodo chiya Samweli chiyalongile kusonhela ufalume.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samweli kawatanga hamwe wanhu wa Isilaili haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Misipa, <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kolonga, ‘Niwalava Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili na niwakombola muna yamakono ya Wamisili na zisi zimwenga zose zimuwoneleni.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Mbali diyelo mumulema Mulungu wenu, yomkombolani muna yamagayo yenu yose na manhesa. Na mulonga, ‘Bule, chikile mfalume.’ Lelo gendeni haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kwa makabila yenu na ng'holo zenu muladi imwe yasaguligwe.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Samweli kayagala kuulongozi makabila yose ya Isilaili, kabila da Benyamini disaguligwa kwa mhiya. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Maabaho kadigala kuulongozi kabila da Benyamini, lukolo kwa lukolo, lukolo lwa Wamatili lusaguligwa kwa kutowa mhiya. Maabaho Sauli mwana wa Kishi kasaguligwa kwa kutowa mhiya, mbali viwamzahile hawamuwonile. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ivo wamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Kuna munhu hanakwiza kuno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Mndewa Mulungu kawedika, “Loleni, koifisa hana zimbahasha.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ivo wakimbila na wamgala Sauli, viyemile hagati ya wanhu kawa mtali kufosa wanhu wose. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli kawalongela wanhu wose, “Mumuwona munhu iyamsagule Mndewa Mulungu? Habule munhu imwenga yalingile fana yeye hagati ya wanhu wose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Maabaho wanhu walandula madizi yawo, walonga, “Mfalume yakale lusita lutali!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Samweli kawalongela wanhu haki na sang'hano za mfalume. Kazandika muna ichitabu na kuchika haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Maabaho Samweli kawalongela wanhu wose chila munhu yahite ukaye yake. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Sauli iviya kahita ukaye yake uko Gibea, kakala hamwe na magalu waja, Mulungu kawaguma moyo kuhita hamwe nayo. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Mbali wamwenga weli watatali walonga, “Munhu ino kezachikombolaze?” Wamzeha Sauli na hawamwing'hile chinhu chochose. Mbali Sauli hawonile ludoko.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kowahuma Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Mfalume Nahashi Mwamoni keza na watowang'hondo wake kudizunguluka bululu da Yabeshi Gileadi. Wanhu wose wa bululu ijo wamulongela Nahashi, “Chitendele lagano da tindiwalo, chizalangulizigwa na weye.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Mbali Nahashi Mwamoni kawalongela, “Nizatenda lagano na mweye. One muhatogola, nizawaguma chinyala Waisilaili wose kwa kung'ola ziso da kulume da chila munhu.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Walala wa Yabeshi walonga, “Ching'he siku saba muladi chitume wasenga muna iisi yose ya Isilaili, one habule yondayachikombole, chizahumigwa na weye.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Wasenga viwafikile uko Gibea, hanhu Sauli hayakalile yokala, wawalongela wanhu mbuli iyo na wanhu wose wandusa kulila. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Sauli kakala yokwiza kulawa kuna umgunda kuno kawalongoza ng'ombe wake, kauza, “Habali chila munhu kolila?” Nawo wamulongela mbuli ziwalongile wanhu walawile Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Bahaja Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umulongoza Sauli na kumtenda yawone ludoko. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Kasola ng'ombe walume waidi, kawakanha vihande vingi, maabaho kawatuma wasenga wagale vihande viya muna iisi yose ya Isilaili, walonga, “Munhu yoyose hawasondelela Sauli na Samweli, ng'ombe wake wezatendigwa fana vino!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Kwa ichimu icho Mndewa Mulungu kawadumbiza Waisilaili. Ivo Waisilaili wose wailumba fana munhu imwe viwalawile kuhita kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli kawaduganya hamwe na kawapeta uko Bezeki. Wakala walume 300,000 kulawa Isilaili na walume 30,000 kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Wawalongela wasenga wezile kulawa Yabeshi, “Walongeleni walume wa Yabeshi Gileadi, ‘Igolo zuwa vondajake ng'hani mwizalopoligwa.’ ” Wasenga viwawalongele wanhu wa Yabeshi, wadeng'helela. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ivo wanhu wa Yabeshi wawavwizila Waamoni, walonga, “Igolo chizatogola kuhumigwa na mweye, mwizachitendela chochose chomuwona chiwanogela.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Sauli kakala kawapanga watowang'hondo muna yamabumbila matatu, igolo yake imitondo ng'hani wawatowa. Wandusa kuwakoma Waamoni na kugendelela mbaka imisi. Waamoni wasigale wapwililika wose mbaka habule hata wanhu waidi wasigale hamwe.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Maabaho wanhu wamulongela Samweli, “Wakulihi wanhu walongile Sauli hadaha kuwa mfalume? Wagaleni chiwakome!”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Mbali Sauli kalonga, “Habule munhu yondayakomigwe diyelo, kwaviya diyelo Mndewa Mulungu kawalopola Waisilaili.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Maabaho Samweli kawalongela wanhu, “Haya, chihite Giligali muladi chikaitogolele kuwa Sauli yagendelele kuwa mfalume wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ivo wanhu wose wahita Giligali, uko wamtogola Sauli kuwa mfalume wawo. Wanhu walava nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Sauli na Waisilaili wose wadeng'helela ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samweli kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samweli kawalongela Waisilaili wose, “Nimwing'hani mfalume fana vimunipulile. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Lelo muna mfalume wa kumulangulizani. Niye mulala na nina uhenga na wanangu wahamwe na mweye. Nimulangulizani kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga mbaka diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Nabaha. Nilongelezeni haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na yoyasaguligwe na Mulungu kuwa mfalume. Nisola ng'ombe wa yelihi? Hebu nisola chihongwe wa yelihi? Hebu nimbamanya yelihi? Hebu nimuwonela yelihi? Hebu kwa mkono wa yelihi nihokela lushwa initule yameso? Nizambwelezelani.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Waisilaili wedika, “Huchibamanye na huchiwonele na husolile chochose kulawa muna umkono wa munhu yoyose.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu na munhu yamsagule kuwa mfalume ni wakalangama wenu diyelo kwa chiya chimulongile.” Wawo wamwidika, “Mndewa Mulungu iyo mkalangama.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Maabaho Samweli kawalongela, “Niiyo Mndewa Mulungu kawasagula Musa na Haluni kuwa walangulizi wenu na kuwalava wasaho zenu muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Lelo imeni hano, muladi nimulongelezeni haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kwa kutambula sang'hano zose zinogile za Mndewa Mulungu zoyawatendele mweye na wasaho zenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobo viyahitile Misili, wasaho zenu wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu yawataze, nayo kawatuma Musa na Haluni. Wawalava wasaho zenu muna iisi ya Misili na wawagala kukala muna iisi ino. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Mbali wasaho zenu wamzimiza Mndewa Mulungu, ivo kawaleka wahumigwe na Wafilisiti na mfalume wa Moabu na Sisela yakalile mulangulizi wa watowang'hondo wa Hazoli. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Iviya wasaho zenu wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu yawataze. Walonga, ‘Chitenda uhasanyi! Chileka kukutambikila weye Mndewa Mulungu, chandusa kuwatambikila Mabaali na Maashitalosi. Mbali sambi one uhachilopola kulawa kwa wehi wetu, chizakutambikila weye.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kawatuma Yelubaali na Balaki na Yefita na Samweli, kamulopolani kulawa muna yamakono ya wehi wenu banzi zose, mweye mukala goya. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Vimumuwone Nahashi mfalume wa Waamoni keza kuitowa na mweye, munilongela, ‘Siivo, mbali mfalume kezachitawala,’ ingawa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu kakala mfalume wenu.<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Lelo ino niiyo mfalume yomumsagule, munhu yomunipulile, Mndewa Mulungu kamwikilani mfalume yamtawaleni. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />One muhamdumba Mndewa Mulungu na kumuhishimu na kumtambikila na kuzindilila malagilizo yake, one mweye na mfalume yomtawalani muhamsondelela Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, mbuli zizakala goya. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Mbali one hamumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu na one hamuzindilila malagilizo yake, kezamtagusani fana viikalile kwa wasaho zenu.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />“Lelo imeni mulole mbuli ng'hulu yondayaitende Mndewa Mulungu kuulongozi wenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Vino diyelo siyo siku ya kuhuna ngano? Nizampula Mndewa Mulungu yagale mbumo na mvula. Muhawona ivo, mwizavimanya kuwa mumuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu vimumpulile yamwing'heni mfalume.” <verse eid="1SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ivo Samweli kampula Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa Mulungu kagala mbumo na mvula siku iyo. Ivo wanhu wose wamdumba ng'hani Mndewa Mulungu na Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Wanhu wose wamulongela Samweli, “Chokulamba uchipulile kwa Mndewa Mulungu cheye wasang'hani wako muladi sekechidanganike, kwaviya chitenda uhasanyi na chongeza uhasanyi wetu kwa kulonda mfalume.” <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli kawedika “Sekemudumbe, kweli mutenda wihi uno wose, mbali sekemuleke kumsondelela Mndewa Mulungu na msang'hanileni yeye kwa mizoyo yenu yose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Sekemutambikile nyang'hiti za milungu zili hazifaya chochose! Izo zabule udahi wowose na hazidaha kumtazani hebu kumulopolani vomukuwa muna yamagayo. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Mndewa Mulungu hezawaleka wanhu wake muladi wanhu wose wadimanye zina jake kulu, kwaviya imnogela muwe wanhu wake. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Nizakuwa nimuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu one nihaleka kumpulilani! Nizamfunzani kukala vinogile na voilondeka. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Mbali mumdumbe Mndewa Mulungu na mumsang'hanile kwa waminika na kwa mizoyo yenu yose. Kumbukeni viyamtendeleni mbuli ng'hulu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Mbali one muhagendelela kutenda mbuli zihile, mwizawingigwa mweye na mfalume wenu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kowatowa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli kakala mwaka umwe na maabaho kawa mfalume. Viyalangulize isi ya Isilaili miyaka midi, <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli kasagula walume wa Isilaili 3,000. Walume 2,000 wakala hamwe nayo uko Mikimashi na kuna isi ya vilima ya Beseli. Walume 1,000 wakala hamwe na Yonasani uko Gibea muna iisi ya Benyamini. Wanhu wasigale kawalongela chila munhu yabwele ukaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani kawahuma Wafilisiti wakalile muna dilago uko Geba, Wafilisiti wahulika mbuli iyo. Sauli katowa mhalati muna iisi yose, kalonga, “Waisilaili nawahulike.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Waisilaili wose wahulika kuwa Sauli kawatowa Wafilisiti muna dilago jawo, lelo Wafilisiti wawehila ng'hani Waisilaili. Ivo wanhu waiduganya hamwe kuilumba na Sauli uko Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Wafilisiti waiduganya hamwe muladi kuitowa na Waisilaili, matololi 30,000 ya kubululigwa na falasi na wakwelafalasi 6,000 na wanhu wengi fana msanga wa mhwani. Wakwela uchanyha na kwika lago jawo uko Mikimashi ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa Besi Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Waisilaili viwawonile kuwa wamuna yamagayo, mana watowigwa ng'hani, wanhu waifisa muna yamatuka na muna yamakombo na muna imiluwe na kuna yamaleme na muna yamasima. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Waisilaili wamwenga waloka lwanda lwa Yoludani wengila muna iisi ya Gadi na Gileadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sauli kakala uko Giligali, wanhu wose wamsondelela kuno wogudemeka kwa kudumba. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Kawagoza siku saba, lusita lwikigwe na Samweli. Mbali Samweli hezile Giligali, ivo wanhu wa Sauli wandusa kupwililika. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ivo Sauli kalonga, “Nigalileni nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo.” Nayo kalava nhambiko ya kutimbula. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Viyakomeleze kulava nhambiko ya kutimbula, Samweli keza. Sauli kahita kumuhokela na kumulamsa. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli kamuuza, “Kutenda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli kamwidika, “Viniwonile wanhu wopwililika na weye hwizile kwa lusita lwikigwe, iviya Wafilisiti waiduganya hamwe uko Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nigesa kuwa sambi Wafilisiti wezanizila kuno Giligali kunitowa na niye sipulile kutazigwa na Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo nilondeka kulava nhambiko ya kutimbula.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli kamulongela Sauli, “Kutenda ubozi, huzindilile lagilizo diyakulagilize Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako. One uhazindilile, Mndewa Mulungu yahawatendile welesi wako kuwa wafalume wa Isilaili siku zose. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Mbali lelo ufalume wako hawizagendelela. Mndewa Mulungu kezamwing'ha munhu mwene moyo wa kumnogeza. Nayo Mndewa Mulungu kamulagiliza yawe mulangulizi wa wanhu wake, kwaviya weye huzindilile lagilizo jake.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samweli kasegela Giligali na kahita Gibea muna iisi ya Benyamini, Sauli kawapeta walume wakalile hamwe nayo, wakala 600. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na Yonasani mwanage na wanhu wakalile hamwe nawo, weka lago jawo uko Geba muna iisi ya Benyamini, mbali Wafilisiti weka lago jawo uko Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Wahokaji walawa muna dilago da Wafilisiti vibumbila vitatu, chibumbila chimwe chihindukila nzila yoihita bululu da Afula mbaka isi ya Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Wamwenga wahindukila nzila yoihita Besi Holoni, chibumbila chimwenga chihindukila nzila ya muna imhaka yoihita kuna dibawe da Seboimu ubanzi wa kuchuwala.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Hakukalile na muhunzi yoyose muna iisi yose ya Isilaili, kwaviya Wafilisiti walonga, “Buleivo Waisilaili wezatenda na migoha.” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Waisilaili wose wahita kwa Wafilisiti kunola magembe yawo na sengo zawo na nhemo zawo na masululu yawo. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Walondeka kuliha hela nyingi kunola gembe na sululu na uma na nhemo na migoha. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ivo muna isiku ya ng'hondo habule mtowang'hondo yakalile na panga hebu mgoha, mbali Sauli na Yonasani mwanage wakala navo.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Wafilisiti wagala bumbila da watowang'hondo kukaliza nzila isonhela Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani kowahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Siku dimwe Yonasani mwana wa Sauli kamulongela ija imbwanga yeli mpagazi wa via vake va ng'hondo, “Chihite kwa watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti kuja kuumwambu.” Mbali hamulongele tati yake. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli kakala yokala hasi ya mbiki wa mkomamanga uli uko Migiloni habehi na Gibea. Walume magana sita wakala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Mwa iwawo Ahiya kakala mkulu wa nhambiko mwana wa Ahitubu ndugu yake Ikabodi. Wasaho wa Ahiya kakala Finehasi mwana wa Eli yakalile mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Shilo, yavalile chizibawo. Wanhu hawavimanyile kuwa Yonasani kasegela.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Chila ubanzi wa kolongo Yonasani hoyalondile kuloka muladi kufika kwa Wafilisiti, kukala na mulima wa luwe. Mulima wa ubanzi umwe wa kolongo utangigwa Bosesi na wa ubanzi umwenga wa kolongo utangigwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Mulima umwe ukala ubanzi wa kasikazi habehi na Mikimashi, umwenga ukala ubanzi wa kusi habehi na Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani kamulongela ija mbwanga mpagazi wa na migoha yake, “Chiloke chihite kwa wanhu hawagumigwe ulungwana. Yodahika Mndewa Mulungu kezachitaza, kwaviya habule chondachimkimilile kuchikombola hata one chahawa wengi hebu wadodo.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Mbwanga ija kamwidika, “Tenda chochose chiulonda, niye nahamwe na weye muna umoyo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasani kalonga, “Chizaloka kuhita kwa wanhu na kuilagusa kumwawo. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />One wahachilongela chiwagoze mbaka vondawachizile, chizawagozela na hachizahita kumwawo. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Mbali one wahachilongela chihite kumwawo, chizahita, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kachitenda chiwahume. Chino chizakuwa chilaguso chetu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ivo wailagusa kwa watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti, Wafilisiti walonga, “Waisilaili wolawa muna yamakombo mowaifisile!” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Wafilisiti waja wawatanga Yonasani na imbwanga ija, walonga, “Kweleni uchanyha kuno kochili, chizamfunzani kuitowa.” Yonasani kamulongela ija yopapa silaha zake, “Kwela kuchisogo changu kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wahumigwe na Waisilaili.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yonasani kakwela kwa makono yake na magulu yake, na ija imbwanga kamsondelela. Yonasani kawatowa Wafilisiti na wagwa hasi, na ija imbwanga kawakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Ukomaji wa mwanduso Yonasani na ija imbwanga wawakoma wanhu malongo maidi hana ihanhu heli na ukulu wa nusu heka.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Kukala na gudemeko muna yamalago na muna imigunda na wanhu wa muna zimhongono na wahokaji nawo wagudemeka, isi iviya igudemeka. Ivo kukala na gudemeko kulu ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wowawinza Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Wakalizi wa Sauli uko Gibea muna iisi ya Benyamini wawona Wafilisiti wokimbila kuno na uko.<verse eid="1SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli kawalongela wanhu wakalile hamwe nayo, “Wapeteni watowang'hondo muladi muvimanye welihi wahabule.” Viwawapetile, wawona Yonasani na imbwanga mpagazi wa na migoha yake wahabule. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli kamulongela Ahiya, “Digale hano sanduku da lagano da Mulungu.” Kwaviya sanduku ijo dikala hamwe na Waisilaili. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sauli viyakalile kolonga na mkulu wa nhambiko, nyangi zongezeka muna dilago da Wafilisiti. Ivo Sauli kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko, “Leka, sekeudigale kaidi sanduku da lagano.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Sauli na wanhu wakalile hamwe nayo waiduganya na wahita kuna ing'hondo. Wawafika Wafilisiti wana lukwale, kwaviya wakala woitowa kwa wawo kwa wawo. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Waisilaili wawo wakalile hamwe na Wafilisiti, wahitile hamwe nawo kuna yamalago yawo, wahita kuilumba na Waisilaili wakalile hamwe na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Waisilaili wose waifisile muna iisi ya vilima ya Efulaimu viwahulike kuwa Wafilisiti wakimbila, wawawinga muladi wakawatowe. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawalopola Waisilaili siku iyo. Ng'hondo igendelela na mbaka ifosa Besi Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonasani koja uki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Siku iyo Waisilaili wagaya ng'hani, kwaviya Sauli kawalahiza wanhu, kalonga, “Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yoja ndiya yoyose mbaka ichigulogulo na niye nizawalihilizila wehi wangu.” Ivo habule munhu yalanzile ndiya. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Watowang'hondo wose wengila mwiimbago, umo mukala na uki hasi. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Watowang'hondo viwengile mwiimbago, uki ukala wolagala, mbali habule hata munhu imwe yagumile mkono wake kumulomo kwaviya wadumba chilaho. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Mbali Yonasani hahulike tati yake viyawalagilize wanhu kwa chilaho. Ivo kenula fimbo ikalile muna umkono wake na kaivabika muna dilala da uki, maabaho kaja na kapata nguvu. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Munhu imwe kamulongela, “Tati yako kawalagiliza wanhu kwa chilaho, kalonga, ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yoja ndiya diyelo!’ Lekamana wanhu wabule nguvu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani kalonga, “Tati yangu kawagaza wanhu. Loleni, vinilanzile uki nipata nguvu. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ihawile vinoga diyelo wanhu waje vinhu viwawahokile wehi wawo. Chihadahile kuwahuma Wafilisiti wengi ng'hani.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Waisilaili wawatowa Wafilisiti kwandusila Mikimashi mbaka Aiyaloni. Wanhu wakala wahungukilwa na nguvu ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Wanhu wavizumhila vinhu viya viwawahokile kulawa kwa wehi wawo, wasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na madang'ang'a, wawachinja baho baho hasi. Wanhu waja nyama izo hamwe na damu. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Wamulongela Sauli, “Lola, wanhu womuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu kwa kuja nyama ili na damu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sauli kalonga, “Muleka kuzindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu, bimbiliseni dibwe dikulu sambi baha.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Maabaho Sauli kawalongela, “Hiteni kwa wanhu mukawalongele, ‘Chila munhu yanigalile ng'ombe na ng'hondolo, muwachinje muje. Sekemumuhasanye Mndewa Mulungu kwa kuja nyama ili na damu.’ ” Ivo ichilo icho wanhu wose wagala ng'ombe wawo na kuwachinja baho. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Maabaho Sauli kamzengela lupango Mndewa Mulungu, ikala mwanza wake wa mwanduso kutenda ivo.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Sauli kalonga, “Chihite kuwawinza Wafilisiti ichilo chino na kuwasolela vinhu vawo mbaka imitondo, sekechimuleke mgima hata munhu imwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Wawo wamwidika “Tenda chochose chiuwona chinoga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Mbali mkulu wa nhambiko kalonga, “Leka chimpule Mulungu hano.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ivo Sauli kamuuza Mulungu, “Nodaha kuwatowa Wafilisiti? Vino kwizawatenda wahumigwe na Waisilaili?” Mbali Mulungu hamwidike siku ija. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Sauli kalonga, “Izoni hano mweye walangulizi wose wa wanhu muladi muvimanye na kuwona uhasanyi utendigwe diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Noilaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu yeli mgima yowalopola Waisilaili, hata one yahawa mwanangu Yonasani, kolondeka yakomigwe.” Habule munhu yamwidike. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Maabaho Sauli kawalongela Waisilaili wose, “Mwizakwima ubanzi uja, niye na mwanangu Yonasani chizakwima ubanzi umwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Wamwidika., “Tenda chochose chiuwona chinoga.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli kampula Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kalonga, “Habali hunidike msang'hani wako diyelo? One ubananzi uhawa wangu hebu wa mwanangu Yonasani, weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, umtende mkulu wa nhambiko yapigise dibwe doditangigwa Ulimu, one ubananzi uhawa wa Waisilaili, umtende mkulu wa nhambiko yapigise dibwe doditangigwa Sumimu.” Mkulu wa nhambiko kapigisa, baho Yonasani na Sauli wawoneka wabananga, mbali wanhu wawoneka wabule ubananzi. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Maabaho Sauli kalonga, “Pigiseni mabwe muladi kusagula hagati yangu na mwanangu Yonasani.” Mkulu wa nhambiko katenda ivo, Yonasani kawoneka kabananga.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Maabaho Sauli kamulongela Yonasani, “Nilongele kutenda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonasani kamwidika, “Nilanza uki kwa balati jangu. Lelo nolondeka nidanganike.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli kalonga, “Mulungu yanitendele vino na kufosa, kwaviya kweli Yonasani kwizadanganika.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Wanhu wamulongela Sauli, “Vino Yonasani kezadanganika ija yachigalile uhumi mkulu muna iisi ya Isilaili? Aka! Fana Mndewa Mulungu viyeli mgima, halwizalagala hata lunyele lumwe lwa ditwi jake, kwaviya kasang'hana hamwe na Mulungu diyelo.” Ivo wanhu wawo wamkombola sekeyadanganike.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Sauli kaleka kuwawinza Wafilisiti, nawo wahita kumwawo.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kowatowa wehi wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli viyekigwe kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili, kaitowa na wehi wake wose chila ubanzi, kaitowa na Moabu na Waamoni na Edomu na wafalume wa Soba na Wafilisiti. Hohose kawahuma. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Nayo kawatowa kwa ugalu Waameleki na kuwalopola Waisilaili muna yamakono ya waja wawatekile.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Wana wa chilume wa Sauli wakala Yonasani na Ishivi na Malikishua, mwana wa chike imkulu wa Sauli katangigwa Melabu na imdodo katangigwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Muke wa Sauli kakala Ahinoamu mndele wa Ahimaasi. Mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa Sauli kakala Abineli mwana wa chilume wa Neli. Neli kakala tata mdodo wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kishi kakala tati yake Sauli na Neli tati yake Abineli wakala wana wa Abieli. <verse eid="1SA 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Kukala na ng'hondo ng'hulu ng'hani hagati ya Wafilisiti siku zose za Sauli. Sauli viyamuwone munhu galu hebu mwene nguvu yoyose kamsola muladi yailumbe na watowang'hondo wake.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili woitowa na Waameleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli kamulongela Sauli, “Mndewa Mulungu kanituma nikuhake mavuta uwe mfalume wa wanhu wake Waisilaili, tegeleza usenga wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, kolonga, ‘Nichika muumoyo chila chinhu Waameleki chiwawatendele Waisilaili viwalawile Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Hiteni mukawatowe Waameleki na kuvibananga vinhu vose viweli navo. Sekemuleke chinhu, sekemuwawonele ubazi, wakomeni walume na wanaake na wana na ving'hele na ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na ngamia na vihongwe.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli kawatanga wanhu wake na kawapeta uko Telemu, watowang'hondo wogenda kwa magulu wakala 200,000 na wanhu wa Yuda wakala 10,000. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Sauli kahita kuna dibululu da Amaleki na kadisepa kuna dikolongo. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli kawalongela Wakeni, “Segeleni kwa Waamaleki muladi sekenimnangeni hamwe nawo, kwaviya wasaho zenu wawatendela Waisilaili mbuli zinogile viwalawile Misili.” Ivo Wakeni wasegela kwa Waamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli kawatowa Waamaleki wose kwandusila Havila mbaka Shuli ili ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Kamgwila Agagi mfalume wa Waamaleki na kawakoma wanhu wose kwa panga. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Mbali Sauli na wanhu wake hawamkomile Agagi, iviya hawawakomile ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na madang'ang'a yanenehe na wanang'hondolo na chochose chinogile na hawawanangile. Chila chinhu chihile chili hachifaya wachinanga.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu komulema Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Maabaho mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Samweli, ilonga, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Muhavu sigambenimwike Sauli kuwa mfalume, kwaviya kanihinduka, kalema kunisondelela na hatendile vinimulagilize.” Samweli kakala na usungu na kamulilila Mndewa Mulungu ichilo chose. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Imitondo ng'hani Samweli kahita kulonga na Sauli, mbali kalongeligwa, “Sauli kafika bululu da Kalimeli na kasimika mabwe ya lukumbuso kwa ichimu chake mwenyewo, kahinduka na kahita Giligali.” <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samweli viyahitile kwa Sauli, Sauli kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu yakutemele mate Samweli! Niyazindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli kauza, “Habali nohulika ng'hondolo na ng'ombe wolila?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli kalonga, “Wawasola kulawa kwa Waameleki. Wanhu hawawakomile ng'hondolo na ng'ombe wanenehe, muladi wawalave nhambiko kwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, mbali wamwenga wasigale chiwananga ng'hani.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Maabaho Samweli kamulongela Sauli, “Nyamala! Nizakulongela mbuli zoyanilongele Mndewa Mulungu ichilo chifosile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sauli kamwidika, “Nilongele.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli kalonga, “Ingawa kuiwona kwa mdodo muna dikabila jako, vino hutendigwe kuwa mtawala wa makabila ya Isilaili? Mndewa Mulungu kakuhaka mavuta uwe mfalume wa Isilaili. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kakutuma na kakulagiliza, kalonga, ‘Hita ukawanange Waamaleki wahasanyi, uitowe nawo mbaka uwadanganize wose.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Lelo habali humtegeleze Mndewa Mulungu? Habali kusola vinhu vihokigwe na kutenda mbuli zihile haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli kamulongela Samweli, “Nizindilila dizi da Mndewa Mulungu nihita kuja koyanhumile Mulungu. Niwadanganiza Waamaleki wamwenga wose, mbali nibwela na Agagi mfalume wawo. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Wanhu wasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe wanenehe ng'hani walondeke kunangigwa hamwe na vinhu viwahokile muladi wamulavile Mndewa Mulungu wako fana nhambiko hano Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Samweli kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">“Vino Mndewa Mulungu kolonda nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko zimwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Hebu kolonda kutegeleza dizi jake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Kutegeleza kunoga ng'hani kufosa kulava nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">na kuhulika kunoga ng'hani kufosa bambala da bebelu da ng'hondolo.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kwaviya kuleka kumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu kulinga fana uhasanyi wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">udugi ulinga fana wihi na kutambikila nyang'hiti za milungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">Kwaviya kuilema mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">nayo kakulema sekeuwe mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli kamulongela Samweli, “Nihasanya, nileka kuzindilila ndagilizi ya Mndewa Mulungu na mbuli zako. Niwadumba wanhu wangu, ivo nitenda viwalondile. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Nokulamba unilekelele uhasanyi wangu na ubwele hamwe na niye muladi nimtambikile Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samweli kamulongela, “Sizabwela hamwe na weye. Kuilema mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kakulema sekeuwe mfalume wa Isilaili!”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samweli viyahinduke muladi yasegele, Sauli kamha mhindo ya walo jake na didegeka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samweli kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kaudega ufalume wa Isilaili kwandusila diyelo na kamwing'ha Muisilaili miyago yanogile kufosa weye. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Mulungu wa siku zose wa Isilaili halonga uvwizi na hagalula magesa yake, kwaviya yeye siyo munhu mbaka yagalule magesa yake.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli kamwidika, “Nihasanya. Mbali nokulamba unihishimu haulongozi wa walala wa wanhu wangu na Waisilaili na ubwele hamwe na niye muladi nimtambikile Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako.”<verse eid="1SA 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ivo Samweli kabwela hamwe na Sauli, nayo Sauli kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Maabaho Samweli kalonga, “Nigalileni hano Agagi mfalume wa Waamaleki.” Agagi kamuhitila Samweli kuno kohuwila kuilegeha. Agagi kalonga, “Kweli usungu wa ifa umala.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samweli kalonga, “Fana upanga wako viuwatendile wanaake wadanganikiligwe na wana wawo, iviya mami yako kezadanganikiligwa na mwanage.” Ivo Samweli kamkanha Agagi vihande haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Giligali. <verse eid="1SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Maabaho Samweli kahita Lama, Sauli kahita ukaye yake uko Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Ingawa Samweli kamulilila Sauli, Samweli na Sauli hawaiwone kaidi mbaka Samweli viyadanganike. Mndewa Mulungu kawona vinoga sigambeyamtende Sauli kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kohakigwa mavuta kuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Kwizamulilila Sauli mbaka zuwaki, kwandusila vinimulemile sekeyawe mfalume wa Isilaili? Dimemeze mavuta hembe jako uhite kwa Yese wa uko Beselehemu. Nimsagula mwanage imwe kuwa mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samweli kalonga, “Nizadahaze kuhita? Sauli yahahulika mbuli iyo kezanikoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Sola dang'ang'a zike uhite najo, ukalonge, ‘Niza kumulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mgoneke Yese kuna ukulava nhambiko, nizakulagusa choulondeka kutenda. Kwizamuhaka mavuta kwa ichimu changu munhu ija yondanikulagusile.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli katenda viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Viyafikile Beselehemu, walala wa bululu wagudemeka viwaiting'hane nayo. Wamuuza, “Kwiza kwa tindiwalo?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli kawedika. “Ona, niza kwa tindiwalo, niza kumulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu. Isafyeni mweye wenyewo na mwize mulave nhambiko hamwe na niye.” Maabaho kawasafya Yese na wanage na kawagoneka kuna inhambiko.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Viwafikile, Samweli kamuwona Eliabu mwana imkulu wa Yese, Samweli kagesa, “Kweli munhu ino niiyo yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Sekeulole utali wake hebu chihanga chake, kwaviya niye nimulema. Niye silola fana wanhu viwolola. Wanhu wolola lukuli mbali niye nolola moyo.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Maabaho Yese kamtanga Abinadabu na kamfoseza kuulongozi wa Samweli. Mbali Samweli kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu hamsagule ino.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Maabaho Yese kamfoseza Shama. Samweli kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu hamsagule ino.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Ivo Yese kawafoseza wanage saba wa chilume muhala kuulongozi wa Samweli, mbali Samweli kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu hawasagule wano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Maabaho Samweli kamuuza Yese, “Kuna wana wa chilume wamwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese kamwidika, “Kasigala imdodo, mbali kodima ng'hondolo.” Samweli kamulongela, “Tuma wanhu wakamgale, kwaviya hachizakala hasi mbaka yafike.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ivo kamtuma munhu, nayo kamgala. Mwana imdodo kakala na nguvu na yeli na meso yanogile na chihanga chinogile. Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Samweli, “Muhake mavuta muna iditwi munhu ino, kwaviya niiyo yeye!”<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samweli kasola hembe jake dili na mavuta na kamuhaka haulongozi wa sekulu zake. Kwandusila siku iyo na kugendelela Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila Daudi kwa nguvu. Maabaho Samweli kahita Lama. <verse eid="1SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu usegela kwa Sauli na muhe wihile kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu umgaza.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Wasang'hani wa Sauli wamulongela, “Muhe wihile kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu wokugaza. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Leka weye mwenevale wetu uchilagilize wasang'hani wako chili hano chikuzahilile munhu yodaha kutowa bango. Kezatowa lusita muhe wihile kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu vondaukwizile, nayo kezatowa bango na weye kwizanyamala.” <verse eid="1SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Ivo Sauli kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Nizahilileni munhu yadahile kutowa bango vinogile munigalile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Imwe wa wasang'hani wake kalonga, “Nimuwona mwana imwe wa Yese Mbetelehemu kadaha kutowa bango, iviya ni galu wa ng'hondo na kofambula mbuli goya na kana chihanga chinogile. Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe nayo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ivo Sauli kawatuma wasenga kwa Yese, kalonga, “Mtume mwanago Daudi kumwangu yoyodima ng'hondolo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese kasola vihongwe wa kupapa magate na mkoba wa mbende wa divai na mwanaluti, kawatuma kwa Sauli hamwe na mwanage Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi kahita kwa Sauli na kandusa kumsang'hanila. Sauli kamnogela ng'hani Daudi, ivo kawa mpagazi wa via vake va ng'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Maabaho Sauli katuma usenga kwa Yese, kalonga, “Muleke Daudi yasigale na niye mana ninogelwa nayo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Chila lusita muhe uja wihile kulawa kwa Mulungu viumwizile Sauli, Daudi kasola chinubi katowa kwa mkono wake, nayo Sauli kasangalala na kaihulika vinogile na muhe uja wihile umuleka.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Wafilisiti waiting'hana kwa kuitowa ng'hondo uko bululu da Soko muna isi ya Yuda. Weka lago jawo uko Efesi Damimu, hagati ya Soko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli na Waisilaili waiting'hana na weka lago kuna dikolongo da Ela na waisasala kuitowa na Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wafilisiti wema uchanyha ya mulima umwe na Waisilaili wema uchanyha ya mulima umwenga, hagati yawo hakala na kolongo.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Galu imwe yatangigwe Goliati yolawa Gasi, kalawa kunze ya lago da Wafilisiti. Utali wake ukala fana mita nhatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Mditwi jake kavala kofiya ya shaba, iviya kavala chizibawo cha shaba muna imhambaga na nzamo wa chilo malongo matano na saba. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Iviya kavala mbote za shaba muna imigulu yake, iviya kumgongo wake kakala na mwele wa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Muhini wa mgoha wake ukala mgalamu fana mbiki wa mfumaji, nzamo ya chuma cha mgoha bila ya muhini wake chikala chilo saba. Munhu yapapile chinhu chake cha kuigombela kamulongolela. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Nayo kema na kawalandulila dizi watowang'hondo wa Waisilaili, kawalongela, “Habali mulawa na kusasala ng'hondo? Vino niye siyo Mfilisiti na mweye siyo wasang'hani wa Sauli? Saguleni munhu yaitowe na niye. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />One yahadaha kuitowa na niye na kunikoma, chizakuwa watumwa wenu. Mbali one nihamuhuma na kumkoma, mwizakuwa watumwa wetu na mwizachisang'hanila.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Maabaho Mfilisiti iyo kalonga, “Diyelo nowaliga watowang'hondo wa Isilaili, ning'heni munhu chiitowe.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli na Waisilaili wose viwahulike mbuli izo za Wafilisiti, wafa moyo wadumba ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi kakala mwana wa ija Mwefulasi wa Beselehemu ili Yuda yatangigwe Yese. Yese kakala na wana wa chilume wanane. Chipindi cha utawala wa Sauli, Yese kakala mulala ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Waja wana wa Yese iwakulu wahitile hamwe na Sauli kuna ing'hondo wakala watatu. Chaudele kakala Eliabu na wekaidi Abinadabu na weketatu Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi kakala mzuwanda. Waja sekulu zake watatu wamsondelela Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />mbali Daudi kakala kohita kwa Sauli na kubwela muladi yawadime ng'hondolo wa tati yake uko Beselehemu. <verse eid="1SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa siku malongo mane Mfilisiti ija kalawilila na kwima imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Yese kamulongela Daudi mwanage, “Wasolele sekulu zako chilo longo za uhishi na magate yano longo, uwagalile kuna dilago hima hima. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Umgalile vidoto longo va mtindi ija imkulu wa watowang'hondo magana longo. Ukawalaule sekulu zako fana wogendelela vinogile, maabaho nigalile chinhu kulagusa kuwa wose wagima.” <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Lusita ulo mfalume Sauli na sekulu zake Daudi na watowang'hondo wose wa Isilaili wakala kuna dibawe da Ela woitowa na Wafilisiti.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Igolo yake Daudi kalamka chilochilo ng'hani, kawaleka ng'hondolo hamwe na imdimi, kavisola vinhu viya viyalagilizigwe na Yese tati yake. Kafika hana dilago da watowang'hondo, kawafika woipanga hanhu hawo na woguta nyangi za ng'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Watowang'hondo wa Isilaili na watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti waisasala kuitowa. Watowang'hondo wakala woilola. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi kamwing'ha vinhu vake munhu ija yokaliza vinhu, kawakimbilila watowang'hondo na kuwalamsa sekulu zake. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Viyakalile kolonga nawo, Goliati ija galu wa Wafilisiti kulawa Gasi kalawilila haulongozi ha watowang'hondo wa Isilaili fana viyazowele. Daudi nayo kamtegeleza. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Waisilaili viwamuwonile Goliati, wamkimbila kuno wodumba ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Wanhu wa Isilaili walonga, “Mumuwona munhu ino yezile? Kweli keza kuwakeweza Waisilaili. Mfalume Sauli kezamwing'ha utajili mwingi munhu yondayamkome munhu ino. Iviya kezamfungiza zengele na mndele wake na wanhu wa muna ikaye ya tati yake wezailegeha. Iviya hawezaliha kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi kawalongela wanhu wemile habehi nayo, “Vino kezatendigwa choni munhu yondayamkome Mfilisiti ino na kuwakombola Waisilaili kulawa muna ichinyala chino? Mana Mfilisiti ino hengizigwe ulungwana niiyo yelihi mbaka yawalige watowang'hondo wa Mulungu yeli mgima?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Wanhu wamulongela Daudi chinhu chondayeng'higwe munhu yondayamkome Goliati. <verse eid="1SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Eliabu sekulu wake imkulu kahulika Daudi viyakalile kolonga na wanhu. Eliabu kawona ludoko, kalonga, “Habali kwiza? Vino ng'hondolo waja iwadodo kumulekela yelihi kuja kuchuwala? Weye kwa mdugi na niyamanya magoda yako, kwaviya kwiza kulola ng'hondo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi kalonga, “Nitenda choni? Vino sekenilonge mbuli?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Maabaho kamuhindukila munhu imwenga na kamuuza ivo ivo, munhu iyo nayo kamwidika fana ichanduso.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Mbuli ziyalongile Daudi vizihulikike, wanhu wamulongela Sauli, nayo kamtuma munhu yamgale. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi kamulongela Sauli, “Munhu yoyose sekeyadumbe muna umoyo wake kwa ichimu cha Mfilisiti ino. Niye msang'hani wako nizahita kuitowa nayo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli kamulongela Daudi, “Weye hudaha kuhita kuitowa na Mfilisiti ija kwaviya weye mbwanga. Munhu iyo kaitowa ng'hondo kwandusila yang'hali mbwanga.” <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daudi kamulongela Sauli, “Msang'hani wako nizowela kudima ng'hondolo wa tati yangu, chila lusita simba na dubu waheza kugwila mwanang'hondolo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />niye nomsondelela na kumtowa simba, nomkombola mwanang'hondolo muna umulomo wake. One simba hebu mnyama mkali yahanizumhila, nomwamha mazoya yake ya muisingo na nomtowa na kumkoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Niye msang'hani wako nikoma simba wengi na wanyama wengi wakali. Lelo hata ija Mfilisiti hengizigwe ulungwana, yoyawaligile watowang'hondo wa Mulungu yeli mgima, kezakuwa fana wawo. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Mndewa Mulungu yoyanikombole muna imikombe ya simba na mnyama mkali, kezanikombola kwa Mfilisiti iyo.” Sauli kamulongela Daudi, “Hita, Mndewa Mulungu kezakuwa hamwe na weye.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli kamuyawaza Daudi viwalo vake va ng'hondo na kofiya da shaba muna iditwi jake na koti da kuikingila muimhambaga. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Nayo Daudi kaiyawala mawalo yake na kasomeka panga mchigudi na kageza kugenda kwaviya kakala yang'hali hanavigeza. Daudi kamulongela Sauli, “Sidaha kuhita na vinhu vino kwaviya sivigezile.” Daudi kavihambula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi kasola balati jake na kasagula mbwewe tano kulawa muna ichizanda, kaziguma muna umkoba wake. Ng'humbwewe yake ikala muna yamakono imala, kandusa kumsondelela Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komuhuma Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Goliati Mfilisiti kandusa kumkwenhukila Daudi, munhu ija yampapile chinhu chake cha kuigombela kakala haulongozi hake. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mfilisiti ija viyamuwone Daudi kamwehula kwaviya kakala mbwanga, yeli na nguvu na yeli na chihanga chinogile. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati kamulongela Daudi, “Vino niye imbwa mbaka kwiza na balati?” Mfilisiti kamduwila Daudi kwa milungu yake. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Goliati kamulongela Daudi, “Izo hano, lukuli lwako nizaweng'ha ndege wose na wanyama wa kumbago!” <verse eid="1SA 17:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Mbali Daudi kamulongela Mfilisiti, “Weye konizila na mgoha na panga na mwele, mbali niye nokwizila kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, Mulungu wa watowang'hondo wa Isilaili, youmuligile. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Diyelo Mndewa Mulungu kezakuguma muna yamakono yangu. Nizakubwanha hasi na nizakukanha ditwi jako na mitufi ya watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti nizaweng'ha ndege wose na wanyama wa kumbago, muladi wanhu wose wavimanye kuwa Mulungu kamuna iisi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Wanhu wose wowaiting'hane baho diyelo, wezavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu halonda mgoha hebu panga kuwakombola wanhu. Ino ng'hondo ya Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kezamgumani mweye wose muna yamakono yetu.” <verse eid="1SA 17:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati viyamkwenhukile Daudi, Daudi kakimbila hima kuhita kuna ing'hondo kuitowa na ija Mfilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daudi kengiza mkono muna umkoba wake na kalava mbwewe imwe, kaipigisa kwa ng'humbwewe, kamtowa nayo Goliati muna ichihanga, mbwewe imtula Goliati hachanyha hana yameso na ingila mgati. Goliati kagwa chingubingubi. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Ivo Daudi kamuhuma Goliati kwa ng'humbwewe na mbwewe. Kamtowa Goliati na kumkoma, mbali Daudi hakalile na panga mumkono wake. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Daudi kakimbila na kema uchanyha ya Goliati, kasomola panga da Goliati muna iyala yake na kamkoma najo kwa kumkanha muna iditwi. Wafilisiti viwamuwonile galu wawo kadanganika, wakimbila. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Wanhu wa Yuda na wanhu wa Isilaili wandusa kuguta nyangi za uhumi, wawawinga Wafilisiti mbaka Gasi na mbaka kuna zinyivi za Ekiloni. Wafilisiti waja walumile kuna ing'hondo wagwa kuna inzila yoihita Shaalaimu mbaka Gasi na Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Waisilaili viwabwelile kulawa kuwawinga Wafilisiti, wasola vinhu va Wafilisiti muna dilago. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi kasola ditwi da Goliati na kadigala Yelusalemu, mbali via va ng'hondo va Goliati kavika muna dihema jake.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kogaligwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli viyamuwone Daudi kohita kuitowa na Goliati, kamuuza Abineli mkulu wa watowang'hondo wake, “Abineli, vino ino mwana wa yelihi?” Abineli kamwidika, “Weye mfalume fana viukala, niye sivimanyile bule.” <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Mfalume Sauli kalonga, “Lelo uza ino mwana wa yelihi?” <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Daudi viyabwelile kulawa kumkoma Mfilisiti ija, Abineli kamsola na kamgala kuulongozi wa Sauli kuno kamha ditwi da Goliati. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli kamuuza Daudi, “Weye mwana wa yelihi?” Daudi kamwidika, “Niye mwana wa msang'hani wako Yese wa Beselehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Umbwiya wa Daudi na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Daudi viyakomeleze kulonga na Sauli, Yonasani na Daudi wawa wambwiya ng'hani, Yonasani kamnogela Daudi fana viyoinogela mwenyewo. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kwandusila siku iyo na kugendelela Sauli kamsola Daudi yamsang'hanile na hamulekile yabwele ukaye yake. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yonasani kaija sale na Daudi kwaviya kamnogela ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonasani kamsaulila Daudi walo jake, hamwe na panga jake na mhinde yake na mkwiji wake. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Daudi kahuma chila hanhu hoyatumigwe na Sauli, ivo Sauli kamtenda yawe mkulu wa watowang'hondo wake. Mbuli iyo iwadeng'heleza wanhu wose mbaka wasang'hani wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli komuwonela migongo Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Wanhu viwakalile wobwela ukaye hamwe na Daudi viyakomeleze kumkoma Mfilisiti ija, wanaake kulawa mabululu yose ya Isilaili weza kumuhokela mfalume Sauli. Wanaake wawo wakala wokwimba nyila za deng'ho na kuvina na kutowa ngoma na vilimba. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Iviya wakala wovina na kwimba nyila za kwidikila vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">“Sauli kawakoma wanhu maelufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">Nayo Daudi kawakoma wanhu maelufu longo.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli hanogelwe na mbuli za wila uwo, ivo kehilwa na kalonga, “Wamwing'ha Daudi wanhu malongo elufu mbali niye wanhu maelufu. Chisigalile kumwing'ha Daudi ufalume.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kwandusila siku iyo Sauli kamuwonela migongo Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Igolo yake muhe wihile kulawa kwa Mulungu umwizila Sauli kwa kusinhukiza, kakala yolosoka fana mtachichala muna ikaye yake. Daudi kakala kotowa bango fana viyatendaga siku zose. Sauli kakala na mgoha muna umkono wake. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Sauli kagesa, “Nizamuhoma na mgoha mbaka yaibande na ing'huta.” Ivo kampigisila Daudi miyanza midi, mbali Daudi kakwepa miyanza midi yose. <verse eid="1SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli kamdumba Daudi kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo, mbali kamuleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ivo Sauli kamsegeza Daudi kumwake na kamtenda yawe mkulu wa watowang'hondo 1,000, nayo Daudi kalawa na kwingila kulanguliza mabumbila kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Chila chinhu chiyatendile Daudi chidahika, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli viyawonile chila choyatendile Daudi chinoga kandusa kumdumba. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Mbali Waisilaili wose na wanhu wa Yuda wamulonda Daudi, kwaviya kawalongoza vinogile kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komsola Mikali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli kamulongela Daudi, “Ino Melabu mndele wangu imkulu. Nizakwing'ha yawe muke wako, fana wahanisang'hanila kwa ugalu na kuitowa ng'hondo za Mndewa Mulungu.” Mana Sauli kagesa, “Niye sizamkoma kwa mkono wangu, leka Wafilisiti wamkome!” <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Mbali Daudi kamulongela Sauli, “Niye iyo yelihi mbaka mfalume yawe mkoi wangu? Lukolo lwangu na ndugu zangu hawamanyike muna iisi ya Isilaili.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Lusita lwa Sauli vilufikile lwa kumfungiza zengele Melabu kwa Daudi, hatendile ivo, mbali kamfungiza zengele kwa Adilieli wa bululu da Mehola. <verse eid="1SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Mikali mndele imwenga wa Sauli kamulonda Daudi. Sauli viyalongeligwe kadeng'helela ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli kalonga muna umoyo wake, “Leka nimwing'he Daudi mndele ino muladi yawe mtego kumwake. Maabaho Wafilisiti wezamkoma.” Ivo Sauli kamulongela Daudi mwanza wekaidi, “Lelo nizakuwa mkoi wako.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Sauli kawalagiliza wasang'hani wake, kalonga, “Longeni na Daudi kwa mviso, mulongeleni, ‘Mfalume konogelwa na weye ng'hani, mbaka wasang'hani wake wose wokulonda. Lelo togola uwe mkoi wa mfalume.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Wasang'hani wamulongela Daudi mbuli izo, nayo Daudi kawalongela, “Niye ngayengaye na simanyika ng'hani, vino mogesa vihuha niwe mkoi wa mfalume?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Wasang'hani wa Sauli wamulongele chiwalongeligwe na Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli kawalongela, “Mulongeleni Daudi, ‘Mfalume halonda hela ya zengele mbali kolonda uwakome Wafilisiti gana na umgalile magovi yawo, muladi yawalihize chisasi wehi wa mfalume.’ ” Sauli kailunga kumkoma Daudi kufosela Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Wasang'hani wake viwamulongele Daudi mbuli zino, Daudi kanogelwa kuwa mkoi wa mfalume. Ing'hali siku ipangigwe hainafika, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daudi na wanhu wake wahita na kuwakoma Wafilisiti magana maidi. Kasola yamagovi yawo kamgalila mfalume na kampetela muladi mfalume yawe mkoi wake. Ivo Sauli kamwing'ha Daudi Mikali imndele wake.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Sauli viyavimanyile kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na Daudi na iviya Mikali mndele wake kamulonda Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli kagendelela kumdumba ng'hani Daudi na kawa mwihi wake siku zose.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti wahita kuitowa na Waisilaili, mbali chila viwaitowile, Daudi kahuma kufosa wasang'hani wa Sauli. Ivo zina da Daudi digendelela kutogozigwa ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kogeza kumkoma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli kamulongela Yonasani mwanage hamwe na wasang'hani wake wose kuwa wolondeka wamkome Daudi. Mbali Yonasani kamulonda ng'hani Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Ivo kamulongela Daudi, “Tati yangu kolonda kukukoma. Ivo uiteganye, igolo imitondo ukale hanhu haholile na ukaifise. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nizahita na kwima habehi na tati yangu kuna umgunda hanhu hondauwe weye. Baho nizalonga nayo kusonhela weye, chinhu chochose chondanihulike kusonhela weye, nizakulongela.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani kamtogoza Daudi kwa Sauli tati yake, kamulongela, “Weye mfalume, sekeumuhasanye Daudi msang'hani wako, kwaviya hakuhasanye na sang'hano zake zinoga kumwako. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Kwaviya viyamkomile Goliati keka ugima wake muna ihatali, nayo Mndewa Mulungu kaweng'ha Waisilaili uhumi mkulu. Weye viuwone viya kudeng'helela. Habali kolonda kumtendela mbuli zihile munhu yelibule ubananzi fana Daudi kwa kumkoma bila chinhu?” <verse eid="1SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli kamtegeleza Yonasani, maabaho kailaha, “Noilaha fana Mndewa Mulungu yeli mgima kuwa Daudi hezakomigwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Ivo Yonasani kamtanga Daudi na kamulongela mbuli izo zose. Yonasani kamgala Daudi kwa Sauli, nayo kamsang'hanila fana ichanduso. <verse eid="1SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Maabaho kulawilila ng'hondo kaidi hagati ya Wafilisiti na Waisilaili. Daudi kahita kuitowa na Wafilisiti, kawakoma wengi na wamwenga wakimbila. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Siku dimwe muhe yehile kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu kamwizila Sauli. Kakala yakalile ukaye yake kuno kamha mgoha, nayo Daudi kakala yotowa bango. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli kageza kumtowa Daudi kuna ing'huta kwa mgoha wake, mbali yeye kaukwepa mgoha wa Sauli, mgoha uwo uhoma ing'huta. Nayo Daudi kakimbila ichilo icho kakomboka. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Sauli katuma wanhu kuna ikaye ya Daudi muladi wakamsepe na kumkoma imitondo. Mikali muke wa Daudi kamulongela, “One hukimbile kuugombela ugima wako ichilo cha diyelo, igolo kwizakomigwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Mikali kamuhulumusa Daudi muna dizonzo, nayo kakimbila na kahonyoka. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikali kasola nyang'hiti ya mulungu, kaitambalisa muna dikomwa na kaikila mazoya ya luti mditwi jake, maabaho kaigubika na walo. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli viyatumile wanhu wakamgwile Daudi, Mikali kalonga, “Daudi kolumwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Maabaho Sauli kawatuma kaidi wanhu wakamulole Daudi, kawalongela, “Mgaleni hamwangu ivo viyeli muna dikomwa muladi nimkome.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Mbali wanhu viwahitile wafika nyang'hiti muna dikomwa na mazoya ya luti mditwi jake. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sauli kamuuza Mikali, “Habali kunivwizila vino na kumuleka mwihi wangu yanibange?” Mikali kamwidika, “Kanilongela nizakukoma one hunitazile kuibanga.”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daudi kakimbila na kahonyoka, kamuhitila Samweli uko kuna dibululu da Lama na kamulongela chila chinhu chiyamtendele Sauli. Ivo Daudi na Samweli wahita kukala Nayosi. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Sauli kalongeligwa kuwa Daudi kauko Nayosi muna dibululu da Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Sauli kawatuma wanhu muladi wakamgwile Daudi, mbali viwawonile bumbila da walotezi wolotela na Samweli kema fana mulangulizi wawo, Muhe wa Mulungu uwezila wanhu wa Sauli, nawo iviya walotela. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli viyalongeligwe, kawatuma wanhu wamwenga, nawo iviya walotela. Sauli kawatuma wanhu wamwenga mwanza weketatu, nawo iviya walotela. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Maabaho yeye mwenyewo kahita Lama, kafika kuna ichisima chikulu chili uko Seku. Kawauza wanhu, “Samweli na Daudi wakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Wamwidika, “Wauko Nayosi muna dibululu da Lama.”<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Ivo Sauli kahita uko Nayosi muna dibulu da Lama. Mbali muinzila Muhe wa Mulungu kamwizila, yeye iviya kandusa kolotela mbaka kafika Nayosi. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Kahambula mawalo yake ya chifalume, nayo iviya kalotela haulongozi wa Samweli na kagona ukengele imisi na ichilo. Ivo wanhu walonga, “Vino Sauli nayo ni imwe wa walotezi?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani komtaza Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Maabaho Daudi kalawa Nayosi kuna dibululu da Lama, kakimbilila kwa Yonasani na kalonga haulongozi wake, “Nitenda choni? Nihasanya choni? Nimuhasanya choni tati yako mbaka kageza kunikoma?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Siivo bule. Hwizadanganika! Lola tati yangu hatenda chinhu chochose chikulu hebu chidodo, yang'hali hananilongela niye. Habali yanifise? Youlonga siyo kweli.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Daudi kailaha kalonga, “Tati yako kavimanya ng'hani kuwa nitogoligwa ng'hani na weye, nayo kagesa muumoyo wake, ‘Yonasani kolondeka sekeyavimanye, buleivo kezakwingilwa mnamilo.’ Mbali fana Mndewa Mulungu viyokala na fana weye viukala, noilaha hasigala hadodo nidanganike.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani kamulongela Daudi, “Chochose choulonda nitende, nizakutendela.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Nayo Daudi kamulongela Yonasani, “Igolo dugila da kwima kwa mwezi, niye nolondeka nije ndiya hamwe na mfalume, mbali nileke niifise kumgunda mbaka chisindo ichigulogulo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />One tati yako yahawona nahabule, mulongele, ‘Daudi kanilamba ng'hani yanileke muladi yalopole Beselehemu kuna dibululu jake, kwaviya nhambiko ya mwaka yolavigwa uko kwa ichimu cha lukolo lwake lose.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />One yahalonga, ‘Vinoga!’ Niye msang'hani wako nizakala kwa tindiwalo. Mbali one yahawona ludoko, uvimanye kuwa kailunga kutenda mbuli ihile. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ivo unitendele yanogile niye msang'hani wako, kwaviya kuija sale na niye haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu hamwe na weye. Mbali one nihabananga, unikome weye mwenyewo. Habali unigale kwa tati yako?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani kalonga, “Haidahika! Mbali one nivimanyile kuwa tati yangu kolonda kukutenda vihile, kweli nihakulongele.”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daudi kamulongela Yonasani, “Yelihi yondayanilongele fana tati yako kezakwidika kwa ludoko?” <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani kamulongela Daudi, “Izo chihite kumgunda.” Ivo wose waidi wahita kumgunda.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Maabaho Yonasani kamulongela Daudi, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili yawe mkalangama. Vondaniyamanye magesa ya tati yangu lusita fana luno igolo hebu chisindo, one kuhawa na mbuli yoidaha kukufaya, kweli nizakulongela mbuli iyo. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Mbali one tati yangu kailungila kukutenda vihile, Mndewa Mulungu yanitendele yehile kwa ludoko one sikulongele na kukulaga uhite kwa tindiwalo. Mndewa Mulungu yawe hamwe na weye fana viyawile hamwe na tati yangu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />One nahagendelela kuwa mgima, nilaguse ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo uja wa Mndewa Mulungu, mbali one nahadanganika, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />sekeusegeze ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo kwa ndugu zangu, hata one luhawa lusita luja Mndewa Mulungu vondayawasegeze wehi wako muna iisi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ivo Yonasani katenda lagano na kaye ya Daudi, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu yawalihilizile wehi wa Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Yonasani kamulongela Daudi yakanhamize kaidi chilaho chake cha kumulonda, kwaviya Yonasani kamulonda Daudi fana voyoilonda mwenyewo.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Maabaho Yonasani kamulongela Daudi, “Igolo dugila da kwima kwa mwezi. Izamanyika kuwa kwahabule, kwaviya chigoda chako chizakuwa chabule munhu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Chisindo ichigulogulo hita hanhu haja howiifisile lusita magayo yano viyanduse, gozela habehi ya dibwe diya da Ezeli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nizapigisa misale mitatu hamgwazo yake, fana nolinga shabaha. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Maabaho nizamtuma mbwanga na kumulongela, ‘Hita ukaizahile misale.’ One nihamulongela, ‘Lola misale ya kuubanzi wako unigalile.’ Maabaho wize, kwaviya kwizakala kwa tindiwalo na habule chinhu chihile, fana viyokala Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Mbali one nihamulongela mbwanga iyo, ‘Gendelela kuulongozi hunafika hana imisale,’ kwizasegela kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakuleka usegele. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kusonhela mbuli ija yochilongile weye na niye, Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mkalangama wa weye na niye siku zose.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ivo Daudi kaifisa mumgunda, dugila da kwima kwa mwezi vidifikile, mfalume Sauli kakala hasi yaje. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Mfalume kakala hanhu hake fana viyazowele, hana ichigoda chikalile habehi na ng'huta. Yonasani kakala kuulongozi wake, Abineli nayo kakala habehi na Sauli, mbali hanhu ha Daudi hakala habule munhu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Mbali Sauli halongile mbuli yoyose siku iyo, kwaviya kagesa, “Kuna chinhu chimulawilila Daudi kumtenda yambule mwiko, kweli kambula mwiko.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Siku yekaidi ya mwezi chigoda cha Daudi chikala chabule munhu kaidi. Sauli kamulongela Yonasani mwanage, “Habali mwana wa Yese hezile kuja ndiya igolo hebu diyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Daudi kanilamba ng'hani nimuleke yahite Beselehemu, <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />kalonga, ‘Nileke nihite kwa ndugu zangu, kwaviya wana nhambiko muna dibululu na ndugu yangu kanilongela nihite. One nihatogoligwa haulongozi wako, nilekele nihite kuwawona ndugu zangu.’ Lekamana hezile hana imeza ya mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Sauli kamuwonela ludoko Yonasani, kamulongela, “Weye mwana wa mwanamke mtatali na yotenda yehile! Novimanya kuwa kusagula kumtegeleza mwana wa Yese. Kwizaiguma chinyala weye mwenyewo na mami yako yakweleke. <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Kwaviya lusita mwana wa Yese yahawa mgima muna iisi, weye hwizakuwa mfalume. Lelo hita ukanigalile, kwaviya kolondeka yadanganike!”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani kamwidika Sauli tati yake, “Habali kolonda kumkoma Daudi? Katenda choni?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Mbali Sauli kampigisila mgoha wake muladi yamkome. Ivo Yonasani kavimanya kuwa tati yake kailunga kumkoma Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonasani kenuka hana imeza kwa ludoko lukulu na siku isondelele hadile ndiya na kasusa kwaviya kamuwonela usungu Daudi na kwaviya tati yake kamguma chinyala.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Igolo yake imitondo Yonasani kahita kumgunda kuiting'hana na Daudi na mbwanga kakala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Kamulongela imbwanga ija, “Kimbila ukazahile misale yoniipigisa.” Mbwanga ija kakimbila, nayo kapigisa msale kuulongozi wake. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Mbwanga ija viyafikile hanhu hoilagalile misale ya Yonasani, Yonasani kamgutila, “Msale hauli kuulongozi wako?” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Yonasani kamgutila kaidi mbwanga ija, kamulongela, “Lopola! Sekeukalame!” Ivo mbwanga ija kadondola misale na kabwela kwa mwenevale wake. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Mbali mbwanga ija hamanyile chochose. Yonasani na Daudi muhala niwawo waimanyile mbuli iyo. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Nayo Yonasani kamwing'ha mbwanga ija via vake va ng'hondo, kamulongela, “Hita na uvibweleze kudibululu.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Mbwanga ija viyahitile, Daudi kenuka haja habehi na idibwe, katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa isi miyanza mitatu, nawo wainonela na walila, mbali Daudi kalila ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Maabaho Yonasani kamulongela Daudi, “Hita kwa tindiwalo kwaviya cheye chose waidi chiilaha kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu, chilonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu kezakuwa hamwe na niye na weye na welesi wangu na welesi wako siku zose.’ ” Daudi kasegela, Yonasani kabwela kuna dibululu.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na gate jelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Maabaho Daudi kahita Nobu kwa mkulu wa nhambiko Ahimeleki. Nayo Ahimeleki kahita kumuhokela Daudi kuno kogudemeka, kamulongela, “Habali kwadumwe kwabule munhu imwenga?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko Ahimeleki, “Mfalume kanilagiliza sang'hano, kanilongela, ‘Munhu yoyose sekeyavimanye chochose kusonhela sang'hano yonikutuma hebu malagilizo yonikulagiliza!’ Niwalagiliza walume hanhu ha kwiiting'hana. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Kuna chinhu chochose? Ning'he magate matano hebu chochose choulinacho.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kamwidika Daudi, “Nabule magate yazoweleke, nina magate yalavigwe kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Nodaha kwing'higwa magate yayo one wanhu wako hawaibandame na wanaake.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi kamwidika mkulu wa nhambiko, “Kweli chiigola na wanaake kwa siku zino ndodo fana viizoweleke muna umwanza. Ng'huli za walume waja zela vochiwa muna imiyanza izoweleke, vino diyelo haizakuwa yela ng'hani?” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ivo mkulu wa nhambiko Ahimeleki kamwing'ha yamagate yaja yelile, kwaviya hakala habule magate yamwenga mbali yaja yekigwe haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, yasakanyigwa na magate yeli moto siku ija viyasegezigwe.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Siku iyo kukala na imwe wa wasang'hani wa Sauli, ija kalondeka kuwabaho haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, zina jake Doegi Mwedomu mkulu wa wadimi wa wanyama wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Maabaho Daudi kamuuza Ahimeleki, “Muna umkono wako kwabule mgoha hebu panga? Sigalile panga hebu via vangu va ng'hondo, kwaviya sang'hano ya mfalume inilonda nisegele himahima.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kalonga, “Panga da Goliati, Mfilisiti ija iumkomile kuna dikolongo da Ela, dino hano difungigwa muna diwalo da kuchisogo ya chizibawo. One uhadilonda usole kwaviya hano habule dimwenga mbali ijo muhala.” Daudi kalonga, “Habule panga dimwenga dilingile ijo, ning'he.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kokimbilila Gasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Siku ija Daudi kambanga Sauli na kahita kwa Akishi mfalume wa Gasi. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Mbali wasang'hani wa Akishi wamulongela, “Vino ino siyo ija Daudi mfalume wa isi? Vino wano hawaimbile na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 21:11">‘Sauli kawakoma wanhu maelufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 21:11">Nayo Daudi kawakoma wanhu maelufu longo?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi kazika mbuli izo muumoyo wake na kamdumba ng'hani Akishi mfalume wa Gasi. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Kaitenda chichala haulongozi wawo, nayo viyakalile haulongozi wawo, kavavatula muna ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu na kayaleka mate yake yalagale muna zindevu zake.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Loleni, muwona kuwa munhu ino kana chichala, habali mumgala kumwangu? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Vino niye nowalonda wanhu wamwenga weli na chichala mbaka mumgala munhu ino muladi yalaguse chichala chake kumwangu? Vino munhu ino kezakwingila muna ikaye yangu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Daudi uko Adulamu na Misipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi kasegela Gasi na kakimbilila kuna dituka da Adulamu. Ndugu zake wose na wanhu wose weli muna ikaye ya tati yake viwahulike, wamsondelela uko. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Wanhu wose wakalile muna yamagayo na wakalile na madeni hebu waja wakalile na usungu muna imizoyo yawo, waiduganya kwa Daudi, nayo kawa mulangulizi wawo. Wanhu wose wakala fana magana mane.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kulawa uko Daudi kahita Misipa uko Moabu, Daudi kamulongela mfalume wa Moabu, “Nokulamba watogolele tati yangu na mami yangu weze wakale na weye mbaka vondanivimanye chondayanitendele Mulungu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ivo kawagala tati yake na mami yake kwa mfalume wa Moabu, wakala hamwe nayo lusita Daudi viyakalile kaifisa muna imhongono.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Maabaho mulotezi Gadi kamulongela Daudi, “Sekeukale hano hana ichifiso. Hita kuna iisi ya Yuda.” Ivo Daudi kasegela kahita kukala kuna imbago ya Helesi.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kowakoma wakulu wa nhambiko wa Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Sauli kahulika kuwa Daudi na wanhu wake wawoneka. Sauli kamhisa mgoha muna umkono, hasi ya mbiki wa mkwazu kuna ichilima uko Gibea na kuno wasang'hani wake wose wema kumzunguluka. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sauli kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Benyamini! Vino mwana wa Yese kezamwing'hani mweye wose masokola na migunda ya mizabibu? Kezamtendani muwe walangulizi wa watowang'hondo magana hebu watowang'hondo maelufu? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Vino lekamana muitogolela kunitendela mbuli zihile? Habule hata imwe wenu yanilongele kuwa mwanangu keka lagano na mwana wa Yese. Habule hata imwe wenu yonitaza hebu kunilongela kuwa mwanangu niiyo yamsongeze msang'hani wangu Daudi yanisepe fana viyotenda diyelo.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Mbali Doegi Mwedomu yemile hamwe na wasang'hani wa Sauli kedika, “Nimuwona mwana wa Yese kohita uko Nobu kwa Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki kampula Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha Daudi na kamwing'ha ndiya na diya dipanga da Goliati Mfilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Mfalume katuma usenga kuwatanga Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu mkulu wa nhambiko na wanhu weli muna ulukolo lwa tati yake wakalile wakulu wa nhambiko uko Nobu. Wawo wose weza kwa mfalume. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli kalonga, “Uhulike sambi weye mwana wa Ahitubu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Nayo kedika, “Nabahano mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli kamuuza, “Habali munitendela mbuli ihile weye na mwana wa Yese? Habali kumwing'ha ndiya na panga na kumpulila kwa Mulungu, muladi yanileke na kunisepa fana viyotenda diyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki kamwidika mfalume, “Vino yelihi imwe wa wasang'hani wako wose yeli mwaminika fana Daudi, mkoi wa mfalume, mulangulizi wa watowang'hondo wako yohishimika ng'hani muna ikaye yako? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Vino niye nyandusa diyelo kumpulila Daudi kwa Mulungu? Siivo bule! Mfalume sekeunigese vihile niye hebu kaye ya tati yangu. Kwaviya niye msang'hani wako simanyile mbuli yoyose.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Mbali mfalume Sauli kamulongela Ahimeleki, “Kweli kwizadanganika weye na kaye ya tati yako.”<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Maabaho mfalume kawalongela wakalizi wakalile habehi nayo, “Wakomeni wakulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya nawo wailumba na Daudi. Wakala wovimanya kuwa Daudi kakala yokimbila na hawanilongele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Mbali wakalizi wa mfalume hawatogole kugolosa makono kuwakoma wakulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Maabaho mfalume kamulagiliza Doegi, “Wakome wakulu wa nhambiko.” Ivo Doegi Mwedomu kawakoma. Siku iyo kawakoma wakulu wa nhambiko malongo manane na watano woyawala vizibawo va chitani. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Iviya Sauli kaditowa Nobu bululu da wakulu wa nhambiko kwa panga, kawakoma walume na wanaake na wana na wana wokong'ha na ng'ombe na vihongwe na ng'hondolo.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Abiasali mwana wa chilume wa Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu, kaibanga na kahita kwiilumba na Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiasali kamulongela Daudi, “Sauli kawakoma wakulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Maabaho Daudi kamulongela Abiasali, “Siku ija viyakalile Doegi Mwedomu nivimanya kezamulongela Sauli. Niye icho ichimu cha kukomigwa kwa wanhu wose weli muna ikaye ya tati yako. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Kala hano sekeudumbe, kwaviya munhu yolonda kukukoma weye niiyo yolonda kunikoma niye. Uhawa hamwe na niye kwizakuwa mgima.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kodilopola bululu da Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Daudi viyalongeligwe, “Lola Wafilisiti woditowa bululu da Keila na wohoka mhule hana ihanhu ha kuhwagila,” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Daudi kamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Nihite kuwatowa Wafilisiti wawo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Hita ukawatowe na kudilopola bululu da Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Mbali wasang'hani wa Daudi wamulongela, “Hano Yuda chodumba. Chizadumba ng'hani one chihahita uko Keila kuwatowa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi kamuuza Mndewa Mulungu kaidi, nayo kamwidika, “Humuluka uhite Keila, kwaviya nizakutenda uwahume Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Daudi na wasang'hani wake wahita kuna dibululu da Keila, waitowa na Wafilisiti na wawahoka ng'ombe wawo na kuwakoma vihile. Ivo Daudi kawalopola wanhu wa Keila. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Lusita Abiasali mwana wa Ahimeleki viyamkimbilile Daudi uko Keila, kamha chizibawo mumkono wake.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli komsepa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli kalongeligwa kuwa Daudi kahita Keila, nayo Sauli kalonga, “Mulungu kamguma muna yamakono yangu, kwaviya Daudi kaifunga mwenyewo kwa kwingila bululu dili na nyivi na mhalalingwe.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Sauli kawatanga wanhu wose wahite kuna ing'hondo uko Keila na kumzinga Daudi na wanhu wake. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi viyamanyile kuwa Sauli kailunga kumtendela mbuli zihile, kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko Abiasali, “Gala hano ichizibawo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Daudi kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, niye msang'hani wako nihulika kuwa Sauli kolonda kwiza kuno Keila kudinanga bululu kwa ichimu changu. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Vino wakaya wa Keila wezanilava yanigwile? Vino Sauli kezakwiza fana msang'hani wako viyahulike? Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, nilongele niye msang'hani wako.” Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Kezakwiza.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi kauza kaidi, “Vino wakaya wa Keila wezaniguma muna yamakono ya Sauli?” Mndewa Mulungu kedika, “Ona, wezatenda ivo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Daudi na wanhu wake magana sita, wasegela Keila na wahita chila hanhu howalondile. Sauli viyalongeligwe kuwa Daudi kakimbila Keila, Sauli hahitile bule uko. <verse eid="1SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Daudi kakala yokala muna zimhongono za chuwala muna izisi za milima muna ichuwala cha Zifu. Sauli kakala yomzahila chila siku, mbali Mulungu hamulekile yamgwile. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daudi viyakalile uko Holeshi muna ichuwala cha Zifu, kavimanya kuwa Sauli keza kumkoma. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana wa Sauli kenuka na kahita kwa Daudi uko Holeshi na kamguma moyo kuwa Mulungu komkaliza. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Kamulongela, “Sekeudumbe Daudi, tati yangu hezakugwila. Kwizakuwa mfalume muna iisi ya Isilaili na niye nizakuwa mtazi wako. Tati yangu Sauli kaimanya mbuli iyo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Wawo waidi waija sale haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Maabaho Yonasani kahita ukaye, mbali Daudi kasigala uko Holeshi. <verse eid="1SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Ivo Wazifi wahita kwa Sauli uko Gibea na wamulongela, “Daudi koifisa kumwetu kuna imhongono uko Holeshi kuna ichilima cha Hakila, ubanzi wa kusi wa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Lelo weye mfalume wize lusita lolose fana voulonda muumoyo wako, cheye chizakutaza kumguma muna yamakono yako.” <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli kedika, “Mndewa Mulungu yamtemeleni mate kwaviya muniwonela ubazi. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Hiteni mukavimanye goya. Mukahamanye hanhu hoyoifisa na yelihi yamuwonile uko, kwaviya nilongeligwa yeye mbala ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Zahileni muhamanye hanhu hoyoifisa, maabaho mubwele kumwangu na mbuli imanyike. Niye nizahita hamwe na mweye. One yahawa muna iisi, nizamzahila mwa ng'holo zose za Yuda.” <verse eid="1SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Nawo wasegela wahita mbaka Zifu wamulongolela Sauli, mbali Daudi na wanhu wake wakala muna ichuwala cha Maoni, umo Alaba ubanzi wa kusi ya Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na wanhu wake wandusa kuwazahila. Daudi viyalongeligwe mbuli iyo, kahumuluka mbaka kuna uluwe na kakala muna ichuwala cha Maoni. Sauli viyahulike mbuli iyo, kamsondelela Daudi kuna ichuwala cha Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli kakala yohita ubanzi uno wa mulima na Daudi na wanhu wake wahita ubanzi umwenga wa mulima. Daudi katenda himahima ng'hani muladi yambange Sauli, kwaviya Sauli na wanhu wake wakala wowazinga Daudi na wanhu wake muladi wawagwile. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Mbali msenga keza kwa Sauli, kalonga, “Izo himahima, kwaviya Wafilisiti woitowa isi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ivo Sauli kabwela na kaleka kumsepa Daudi, kahita kuitowa na Wafilisiti. Lekamana hanhu baho wahatanga “Luwe lwa kuibangila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Maabaho Daudi kalawa uko na kahita kukala muna imhongono ya Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi komuwonela ubazi Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli viyabwelile kulawa kuwatowa Wafilisiti, kalongiligwa kuwa Daudi kauko kuna ichuwala cha Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Ivo Sauli kasola walume magalu 3,000 kulawa muna iisi yose ya Isilaili na kahita kuwazahila Daudi na wanhu wake habehi ya Miluwe ya Lutimbago uko Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Kafika hana ivikwama va ng'hondolo mumgwazo wa nzila, uko kukala na tuka na Sauli kahita mwanza mkulu. Daudi na wanhu wake wakala waumuja muna dituka mbali kwa mgati ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Wanhu wa Daudi wamulongela, “Ino niiyo siku iyalongile Mndewa Mulungu viyakulongele, ‘Nizamguma mwihi wako muna yamakono yako muladi umtendele vovose vondaulonde.’ ” Ivo Daudi kamsepa Sauli bila ya kuwoneka na kakanha mhindo ya walo jake. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Mbali Daudi moyo wake unyunguwala kwaviya kakanha mhindo ya walo da Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Kawalongela wanhu wake, “Mndewa Mulungu yanigome sekenimtendele mbuli ifanile iyo mwenevale wangu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu hebu kumulumiza, kwaviya niiyo yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Daudi kawakalikila wanhu wake na kawagomesa sekewamtowe Sauli. Nayo Sauli kenuka, kalawa muna dituka na kasegela. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Maabaho Daudi kalawa muna dituka na kamtanga Sauli, kalonga, “Mwenevale wangu, mfalume!” Sauli viyahinduke kuchisogo, Daudi kamtumbalila mavindi na kadulisa chihanga chake hasi. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daudi kamulongela Sauli, “Habali kotegeleza mbuli yowolonga wanhu, ‘Daudi kailungila kukulumiza?’ <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Lola, diyelo meso yako yawona viya Mndewa Mulungu viyakugumile muna yamakono yangu muna dituka. Wanhu wamwenga wonilongela nikukome, mbali niye nikuleka, nilonga, ‘Sidaha kumulumiza mwenevale wangu, kwaviya kasaguligwa na Mndewa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Lola tati yangu, nokulamba ulole chihande cha walo jako muna yamakono yangu! Nikanha mhindo ya walo jako mbali sikukomile muladi uvimanye sikuhasanye hebu kukuhinduka. Sikubanange chochose ingawa weye konisaka unikome. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Mndewa Mulungu yachihumize niye na weye na yalihilize kwa yehile younitendela, mbali niye sizakulumiza. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Fana viwalongile wanhu wa umwaka, ‘Mwa wanhu wehi molawa wihi.’ Mbali mkono wangu hawizakutendela yehile.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />“Mfalume wa Isilaili komuwinga yelihi? Komsepa yelihi? Imbwa yafile hebu kupatu? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Mndewa Mulungu yachihumize niye na weye, yaniwone na yanigombele, yanikombole kulawa muna umkono wako.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi viyakomeleze kulonga mbuli izo, Sauli kamuuza, “Daudi mwanangu, weye niiyo ulonga ivo?” Sauli kalila kwa usungu. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />“Weye kotenda yanogile kufosa niye, kwaviya weye kunitendela yanogile, mbali niye nikutendela yehile. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Diyelo kulagusa viya viunitendele yanogile, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kaniguma muna yamakono yako, mbali hunikomile. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Vino munhu yahamuwona mwihi wake kezamuleka yawe mgima? Mndewa Mulungu yakulihe yanogile kwa yano younitendele diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Kweli novimanya kuwa kwizakuwa mfalume. Ufalume wa Isilaili wizagangamala kwa ulangulizi wako. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Lelo unilahile kwa Mndewa Mulungu kuwa hwizawakoma welesi wangu hebu hwizadibananga zina jangu muna uwelesi wa tati yangu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi kamulahila Sauli. Maabaho Sauli kahita ukaye yake, mbali Daudi na wanhu wake wabwela kuna imhongono.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samweli kadanganika. Waisilaili wose waiting'hana hamwe, wamulilila na wamuwanda ukaye yake uko Lama. Maabaho Daudi kahita kuna ichuwala cha Palani.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi na Abigaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Kukala na munhu imwe uko Maoni yakalile na sang'hano uko Kalimeli. Munhu iyo kakala na vinhu vingi ng'hani, kakala na ng'hondolo 3,000 na luti 1,000. Kakala kowakanha mazoya ng'hondolo wake uko Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Munhu iyo katangigwa Nabali na muke wake katangigwa Abigaili. Imuke kakala na ubala na lumondo, mbali mulumake kakala yokalika na yotenda yehile, iviya kakala wa lukolo lwa Kalebu.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Daudi viyakalile kuchuwala, kahulika kuwa Nabali kakala kowakanha mazoya ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Daudi katuma wabwanga longo, kawalongela, “Hiteni kwa Nabali uko Kalimeli muladi kumulamsa kwa zina jangu. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mulongeleni, ‘Tindiwalo diwe kumwako na muna ikaye yako na kwa vinhu vose viuli navo!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />“ ‘Nihulika kuwa kuna wanhu wokanha mazoya ng'hondolo wako. Wadimi wako wakala hamwe na cheye na cheye hachiwatendele yehile. Lusita lose wakala uko Kalimeli mbali habule chinhu chawo chochose chagile. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Wauze wasang'hani wako nawo wezakulongela. Ivo wabwanga wano watogoleke haulongozi wako kwaviya chiza siku ya dugila. Nokulamba uweng'he wasang'hani wako na niye mwanago Daudi chochose chouli nacho.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Ivo wabwanga wa Daudi viwafikile, wamulongela Nabali mbuli zose fana viwalongeligwe na Daudi, maabaho wagozela.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali kawedika wasang'hani wa Daudi, kalonga, “Daudi niiyo yelihi? Mwana wa Yese niiyo yelihi? Siku zino kuna wasang'hani wengi wowabanga wenevale wawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Habali nisole ndiya yangu na mazi yangu na nyama iniwachinjile wakanha mazoya wangu na kuweng'ha wanhu weli siwamanyile walawa kulihi?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Wabwanga wa Daudi wahindula wasegela. Viwafikile wamulongela Daudi mbuli zose. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Daudi kawalongela wanhu wake, “Haya, chila munhu yasole panga jake.” Nawo wasola chila munhu panga jake na Daudi iviya kasola panga jake. Wanhu fana magana mane wakwela hamwe na Daudi na wanhu magana maidi wasigala na mbahasha.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Mbali msang'hani imwe wa Nabali kamulongela Abigaili yeli muke wa Nabali, “Vino kuhulika? Daudi katuma wasenga kulawa kuchuwala weze kumulamsa mwenevale wetu, mbali yeye kawaliga. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Mbali wanhu wano wachitendela yanogile ng'hani, hachipatile dihile jojose hebu hachagiligwe na chinhu chochose vichikalile hamwe nawo kuna umgunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Wawo wakala fana mhongono kumwetu kwa kuchikaliza ichilo na imisi, chikala hamwe nawo lusita lose vichikalile chodima ng'hondolo. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Lelo geseni na muvimanye mwizatenda choni kwa mbuli ino, kwaviya mwenevale wetu kalungiligwa yehile hamwe na kaye yake yose. Yeye mtatali na habule munhu yodaha kulonga nayo.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili hakalame bule. Kasola magate magana maidi na viya vidi va divai na ng'hondolo watano wachinjigwe na chilo longo na saba za uhishi na vipambo gana va zabibu zinyalile na vibuluga magana maidi va nhini, kawapapiza vihongwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Maabaho Abigaili kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Longoleni niye nahachisogo chenu.” Mbali hamulongele Nabali mulumake.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Viyakwelile chihongwe wake na kuhulumuka kuna dikolongo da mulima, Daudi na wanhu wake wahumuluka na waiting'hana nayo. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi kalonga, “Nikaliza vinhu vose va Nabali kuchuwala na sing'higwe chochose, habule chinhu chake chochose chagile. Niye nimtendela yanogile mbali yeye kaniliha yehile. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Mndewa Mulungu yanitendele niye na kongezeka, one ifikile imitondo sigambeyasigale hata mulume imwe muna ikaye ya Nabali.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Viyamuwone Daudi, Abigaili kahulumuka hima muna ichihongwe wake na katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi haulongozi wa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Kaibwanha muna imigulu ya Daudi, kalonga, “Mwenevale wangu ubananzi uno na uwe kumwangu niye. Nokulamba unilekele niye msang'hani wako nilonge na weye, uhulike mbuli zonilonga. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nokulamba mwenevale wangu, sekeumgese munhu ino yeli mtatali Nabali. Yeye kalinga fana zina jake, fambulo da zina jake ni mbozi na ubozi kanawo. Mbali kumwangu niye msang'hani wako, siwawonile wabwanga waja woyawatumile mwenevale wangu.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />“Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kakugomesa weye mwenevale wangu, kukoma na kulihiliza kwa makono yako mwenyewo. Fana viya Mndewa Mulungu voyokala na weye voukala, wehi wako na wose womulungila yehile mwenevale wangu watagusigwe fana Nabali vondayatagusigwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Chitumetume chino msang'hani wako nikugalila weye mwenevale wangu, weng'he wabwanga wokusondelela. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nokulamba unilekelele niye msang'hani wako ubananzi unitendile, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezagangamiza ulangulizi wako na ulangulizi wa wanago, kwaviya weye mwenevale wangu koitowa ng'hondo ya Mndewa Mulungu. Sekeutende dihile jojose siku zose za ugima wako. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />One kuhawa na munhu yolonda kukukoma, sekeutogole dihile jojose diwoneke kumwako siku zose za ugima wako. Mndewa Mulungu kezakukaliza goya mwenevale wangu fana munhu yokaliza mbahasha yake ya hela nyingi. Mbali ugima wa wehi wako wizapigisigwa fana viya mbwewe kulawa muna ing'humbwewe. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Mndewa Mulungu vondayamtendele mwenevale wangu chila chinhu chinogile chiyalongile kusonhela weye na kumwika kuwa mulangulizi wa Isilaili, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />hwizakuwa na wihi hebu ubananzi wa umoyo hebu kwa kukoma hebu kwaviya mwenevale wangu kuilihiliza mwenyewo. Iviya Mndewa Mulungu vondayakutendele yanogile mwenevale wangu, umkumbuke msang'hani wako.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi kamulongela Abigaili, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili yatogolwe, yakutumile uiting'hane na niye diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Utemeligwe mate ulamuzi wako unogile kwa kunikimilila sekenikome diyelo na kulihiliza kwa makono yangu. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kwaviya fana voyokala Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kanigomesa sekenikukome. One hulopole kwiza kuiting'hana na niye, kweli igolo imitondo sigambeyasigale hata mulume imwe muna ikaye ya Nabali.”<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Daudi kahokela vinhu viyeng'higwe na Abigaili, kalonga, “Sekeudumbe, hita ukaye. Nizatenda fana viupulile.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili viyahitile kwa Nabali, kamfika Nabali muna ikaye kotenda dugila fana diya da mfalume. Kakala na deng'ho ng'hani na kakala yakoligwe. Ivo Abigaili hamulongele mbuli yoyose mbaka viuchile. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Viifikile imitondo, Nabali upele viukunguzuke, muke wake kamulongela mbuli izo zose, bahaja lukuli lwa Nabali lufa nene na kanyala mbamba. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Vizifosile siku longo, Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda Nabali yadanganika.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi viyahulike kuwa Nabali kadanganika, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu Yatogogwe ija yamulihilizile Nabali kwa viyaniligile. Mndewa Mulungu kanikimilila niye msang'hani wake sekenitende mbuli zihile, kamulihilizila Nabali kwa wihi uyanitendele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Maabaho Daudi katuma usenga kwa Abigaili kulonda yamsole yawe muke. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wasang'hani wa Daudi wahita Kalimeli kwa Abigaili, wamulongela, “Daudi kachituma kumwako muladi chikusole uwe muke wake.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi, kalonga, “Nizakuwa msang'hani wa Daudi na kuwanava magulu wasang'hani wake.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili kenuka himahima na kakwela chihongwe wake hamwe na wasang'hani wake watano, kahita hamwe na wasenga wa Daudi na kawa muke wake. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Iviya Daudi kamsola Ahinoamu kulawa Yezileeli. Wose waidi wawa wake zake. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Mbali Sauli kamfungiza zengele Mikali mndele wake, yakalile muke wa Daudi kwa Paliti mwana wa Laishi munhu yakalile yolawa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi komuwonela ubazi Sauli kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Wazifi wahita kwa Sauli uko Gibea na walonga, “Vino Daudi haifisile muna ichilima cha Hakila chili habehi na Yeshimoni?”<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Sauli kasegela na kahita kuichuwala cha Zifu, nayo kakala na wanhu 3,000 wa Isilaili waja wasaguligwe muladi kumzahila Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli kasimika hema hana ichilima cha Hakila chochiilola na Yeshimoni mwiinzila ng'hulu, mbali Daudi kakala yokala kuichuwala. Viyawonile kuwa Sauli kamsondelela kuichuwala, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />katuma wanhu wakapelembe, kalongiligwa kuwa kweli Sauli kafika.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi kenuka na kahita hanhu haja Sauli hoyekile lago jake. Daudi kahalola hanhu haja hayagonile Sauli na Abineli mwana wa Neli mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa bumbila jake. Nayo Sauli kakala kagona mgati ya dilago da bumbila jake kuno wamzunguluka.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Ivo Daudi kamuuza Ahimeleki Muhiti na Abishai ndugu yake Yoabu, mami yawo katangigwa Seluya, kalonga, “Yelihi yondayahite hamwe na niye kuna dilago da Sauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishai kamwidika, “Niye nizahita hamwe na weye.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Daudi na Abishai wahita kuna dibumbila da watowang'hondo lusita lwa ichilo. Sauli kakala yagonile muna dilago na mgoha wake ukala usimikigwe hasi habehi na ditwi jake. Abineli na watowang'hondo wakala wagona kumzunguluka Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai kamulongela Daudi, “Lelo diyelo Mulungu kamguma mwihi wako muna yamakono yako. Lelo nilekele nimuhome mbaka muna iisi mwanza umwe muhala. Sizamuhoma miyanza midi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Mbali Daudi kamulongela Abishai, “Sekeumkome! Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezamtagusa munhu yoyose yondayamkome mfalume yoyamsagule. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyokala, Mndewa Mulungu kezamkoma Sauli hebu kezadanganika ifa imanyike hebu kezakomigwa kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Haidahika hata chidogo! Sekenimtowe munhu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Mbali sola umgoha na ichibuyu cha mazi vili habehi ya ditwi jake.”<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ivo Daudi kasola mgoha na chibuyu cha mazi vikalile habehi ya ditwi da Sauli, nawo wasegela. Habule munhu yoyose yamuwonile hebu kuhulika mbuli ino, hebu habule munhu yoyose yalamkile muna zinhongo. Wose wakala wagona, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawaguma vuwevuwe da nhongo.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Maabaho Daudi kaloka umwambu, kema uchanyha ya chilima, hanhu hakalile hatali na bumbila da Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Daudi kawagutila nyangi watowang'hondo na Abineli mwana wa Neli, kalonga, “Abineli konihulika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abineli kamwidika, “Weye yelihi youmtanga mfalume?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi kamulongela Abineli, “Weye siyo galu? Yelihi yalingile fana weye muna iisi ya Isilaili? Lelo habali humkalize mwenevale wako mfalume? Kwaviya munhu imwe keza kumdanganiza mfalume, mwenevale wako. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Mbuli youtendile hainogile bule. Kweli fana Mndewa Mulungu viyokala, weye na wanhu wako molondeka kudanganika, kwaviya hamumkalize mwenevale wenu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Loleni, mgoha wa mfalume na chibuyu cha mazi vovikalile habehi ya ditwi jake vakulihi?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Nayo Sauli kadimanya dizi da Daudi, kalonga, “Ijo dizi jako Daudi mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daudi kamwidika, “Ona niijo dizi jangu, mwenevale wangu mfalume.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Kongezela kulonga, “Habali mwenevale wangu konipelemba msang'hani wako? Nitenda choni? Hebu nibananga choni? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Mbali mwenevale wangu mfalume, nokulamba utegeleze mbuli zangu niye msang'hani wako. One Mndewa Mulungu kakutenda unihile, niye nilave nhosa muladi kumnogeza. Mbali one wanhu watenda ivo, waduwiligwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Mbali wawo waniwinga kulawa ihanhu hangu hana uhazi wa Mndewa Mulungu, wolonga, ‘Hita ukasang'hanile milungu imwenga.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Lelo sekeuleke nikomigwe muna iisi ya wanhu wamwenga kutali na chihanga cha Mndewa Mulungu. Weye mfalume wa Isilaili kulawa kuzahila kupatu, fana viya munhu viyosaka ng'hwale muna imilima.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Maabaho Sauli kalonga, “Nitenda uhasanyi. Bwela Daudi mwanangu. Kwaviya kuwona kuwa ugima wangu wofaya diyelo, sizageza kukulumiza kaidi. Kweli nitenda ubozi na nitenda ubananzi ng'hani.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi kedika, “Mgoha wa mfalume wabahano, mbwanga imwe yaloke yeze kuusola. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Mndewa Mulungu komuliha chila munhu kwa sang'hano zinogile zoyotenda na uwaminika wake. Mndewa Mulungu kakwika muna yamakono yangu diyelo, mbali sizamulumiza munhu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu kwa sang'hano yelile. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Maabaho lola, fana viya ugima wako viufaya haulongozi wangu, iviya ugima wangu ufaye haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu yanilopole muna yamagayo yose.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Maabaho Sauli kamulongela Daudi, “Mwanangu Daudi, nokupulila kwa Mndewa Mulungu yakutemele mate na yakutende uhume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Daudi kasegela, Sauli nayo kabwela kumwake.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi komsang'hanila mfalume Akishi wa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Baho Daudi kagesa muumoyo wake, “Siku dimwe muna zisiku zino, Sauli kezaninanga. Nzila inogile kumwangu ni kukimbilila kuna iisi ya Wafilisiti. Baho Sauli kezaleka kunizahila hohose muna iisi ya Isilaili na nizakuwa nihonyokwa muna yamakono yake.”<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Daudi kasegela hamwe na wanhu magana sita wakalile hamwe nayo, wahita kwa Akishi mwana wa Maoki mfalume wa Gasi. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi na wanhu wake wakala uko Gasi hamwe na Akishi. Chila munhu kakala hamwe na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake. Daudi nayo kakala na wake zake waidi Ahinoamu wa Yezileeli na Abigaili mgane wa Nabali wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli viyalongeligwe kuwa Daudi kakimbilila Gasi, hagendelele kumzahila.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Daudi kamulongela Akishi, “One ihakunogela, nileke nikale muna dibululu dimwe muna imigunda. Sifaya kukala hamwe na weye muna dibululu dino da chifalume.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Siku iyo Akishi kamwing'ha Daudi bululu da Zikilagi. Ivo kwandusila siku iyo Zikilagi diwa bululu da wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi kakala muna iisi ya Wafilisiti lusita lwa mwaka umwe na miyezi mine.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Daudi na wanhu wake wakala wohita kuwatowa Wageshuli na Wagilizi na Waamaleki wakalile wakaya wa isi iyo kwandusila umwaka. Kawatowa muna iisi yawo mbaka Shuli muna imhaka ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daudi kawatowa wanhu wa isi iyo, hamsigaze mulume hebu muke, kasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vihongwe na ngamiya na mawalo. Maabaho kabwela kwa Akishi.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishi viyamuuzile, “Diyelo mutowa ubanzi ulihi?” Daudi kamwidika kwa kumvwizila, “Chiitowa ng'hondo ubanzi wa Negebu ya Yuda hebu ubanzi wa Negebu ya Wayelameeli hebu ubanzi wa Negebu ya Wakeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi hamulekile mgima mulume hebu muke muladi yadahe kumgala Gasi, kwaviya Daudi kagesa, “Wodaha kuchilongeleza na kulonga, ‘Vino niivo viyatendile Daudi.’ ” Vino niivo ili chihendo chake lusita wose luyakalile muna iisi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Akishi kahuwila mbuli za Daudi na kailongela mwenyewo, “Kawatenda wanhu wake Waisilaili wamwihile kwa kuwatowa, ivo kezakuwa msang'hani wangu siku zose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s">Sauli na mulaguzi wa Endoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Siku izo Wafilisiti waduganya watowang'hondo wawo kuhita kuitowa ng'hondo na Isilaili. Akishi kamulongela Daudi, “Uvimanye kuwa weye na watowang'hondo wako mwizahita hamwe na niye kuna ing'hondo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi kamulongela Akishi, “Vinoga! Kwizavimanya chiyodaha kutenda msang'hani wako.” Nayo Akishi kamulongela Daudi, “Vinoga, nizakutenda unikalize siku zose.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Samweli kadanganika, Waisilaili wose wamulilila na wamuwanda kuna dibululu jake uko Lama. Sauli kawawinga walaguzi na wahawi muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Wafilisiti waiduganya na wahita kwika lago uko Shunemu. Sauli kawaduganya Waisilaili wose na weka lago uko Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli viyawawonile watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti, kadumba na kagudemeka ng'hani. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Ivo Sauli viyamuuzile Mndewa Mulungu yatende choni, Mndewa Mulungu hamwidike muna inzozi hebu kwa Ulimu hebu kwa walotezi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Sauli kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Nilondeleni mwanamke yodaha kulagula muladi nihite nikalole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Wasang'hani wake wamulongela, “Kauko imwe uko Endoli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ivo Sauli kaigalusa kwa kuyawala mawalo yamwenga, maabaho yeye na wanhu wake waidi wamuhitila mwanamke iyo ichilo. Sauli kalonga, “Unilotele kwa ulaguzi, unigalile yondanimtambule kumwako.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Lola, weye kovimanya viyatendile Sauli, viya viyawawingile walaguzi na wahawi muna iisi, habali konitegela mtego ugima wangu muladi nidanganike?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli kamulahila kwa Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Fana Mndewa Mulungu viyokala, hwizatagusigwa kwa mbuli ino.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Maabaho mwanamke ija kamuuza, “Nikugalile yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Sauli kamwidika, “Nigalile mzimu wa Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mwanamke ija viyauwone mzimu wa Samweli, kaguta. Maabaho kamuhindukila Sauli, kamulongela, “Habali kunivwizila kuwa weye niiyo Sauli?”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Mfalume kamulongela, “Sekeudumbe. Kowona choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Nowona mzimu wolawa hasi.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli kamuuza, “Ulinga fana choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Nayo kamwidika, “Ulinga fana mulala wa chilume, kaiyawala ng'hanzu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Baho Sauli kavimanya kuwa kakala Samweli. Ivo katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi. <verse eid="1SA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli kamulongela Sauli, “Habali kunitanga na kunigaza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli kamwidika, “Niye nigaya ng'hani kwaviya Wafilisiti woitowa ng'hondo na niye, nayo Mulungu kanileka, hanidike kwa walotezi hebu kwa nzozi. Ivo nikutanga muladi unilongele nitende choni.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli kalonga, “Habali koniuza niye kuno Mndewa Mulungu kakuleka na kawa mwihi wako? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kakutendela fana viyalongile kwa mulomo wangu, Mndewa Mulungu kausegeza ufalume wako kulawa muna yamakono yako na kamwing'ha Muisilaili miyago, niiyo Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Kwaviya weye huditegeleze dizi da Mndewa Mulungu na huwadanganize Waamaleki wose, lekamana Mndewa Mulungu kokutendela vino diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawaguma Waisilaili muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti. Igolo weye na wanago wa chilume mwizakuwa hamwe na niye. Iviya Mndewa Mulungu kezawaguma watowang'hondo wa Isilaili muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Baho Sauli kagwa chingubingubi, kadumba kwaviya kahulika chiyalongile Samweli. Nguvu zimala, kwaviya kakala hanakuja chochose, imisi yose na ichilo chose.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Mwanamke ija viyamuhitile Sauli na kumuwona kogaya ng'hani, kamulongela, “Lola niye msang'hani wako nikutegeleza. Niwika ugima wangu muna iifa na nitegeleza chiya chounilongele. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Sambi unitegeleze niye msang'hani wako, nikakusasalile gate chidogo uje muladi upate nguvu za kugendelela na mwanza wako.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Mbali Sauli kalema, kalonga, “Niye silonda kuja.” Mbali wasang'hani wake hamwe na mwanamke ija wamulamba yaje, nayo kawategeleza chiwalongile. Ivo kenuka hasi na kakala muna dikomwa.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mwanamke ija kakala na dang'ang'a da ng'ombe dinenehe ukaye yake, kadichinja himahima, maabaho kasola usage kaubuluga na katenda gate dilibule lusu. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Maabaho keka ndiya ija haulongozi wa Sauli na wasang'hani wake, nawo waja. Ichilo icho wenuka na wasegela.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisiti womulema Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wafilisiti wawaduganya hamwe watowang'hondo wawo wose uko Afeki, Waisilaili weka lago jawo habehi na nzasa ili uko Yezileeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Wakulu wa Wafilisiti viwakalile wofosa hamwe na mabumbila yawo ya watowang'hondo magana na maelufu, Daudi na wanhu wake wakala kuchisogo hamwe na Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Walangulizi wa Wafilisiti wauza, “Habali Waisilaili wawo wabahano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishi kawedika, “Vino ino siyo Daudi yakalile msang'hani wa Sauli mfalume wa Isilaili? Kahamwe na niye lusita lutali. Kwandusila viyamulekile Sauli mbaka sambi siwonile ubananzi wowose kumwake.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Mbali walangulizi wa Wafilisiti wamuwonela ludoko, wamulongela, “Mbweleze munhu iyo yabwele hanhu hake houmwing'hile. Sekeyahite hamwe na cheye kuna ing'hondo, buleivo kezahinduka na kuwa mwihi wetu. Huwona kuwa munhu ino kezapata nzila inogile ya kuilumba na mwenevale wake na kudumula matwi yetu wenyewo? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Vino siyo ija Daudi yowembile mbuli zake muna uwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">‘Sauli kawakoma wanhu maelufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">Daudi kawakoma wanhu maelufu longo’?”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ivo Akishi kamtanga Daudi, kamulongela, “Fana Mndewa Mulungu viyokala, weye kuwa mwaminika na niye nilonda uwe hamwe na niye muna dibumbila da watowang'hondo. Kwandusila lusita luufikile kumwangu mbaka sambi sinawona ubananzi wowose kumwako, mbali wenevale wamwenga hawakutogola bule. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Ivo bwela kwa tindiwalo, sekeuwatendele dihile jojose walangulizi wa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi kamuuza Akishi, “Nitenda choni? Vino kuwona choni kumwangu niye msang'hani wako, lusita lose lunikalile kumwako mbaka sekenitogoleligwe kuhita kuitowa na wehi wako diyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi kamwidika Daudi, “Niye nivimanya kuwa weye kunoga haulongozi wangu fana viya msenga wa Mulungu, mbali walangulizi wa Wafilisiti walonga, ‘Ino hezahita hamwe na cheye kuna ing'hondo.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Ivo uidawe chilochilo, weye hamwe na wasang'hani wa mwenevale wako Sauli wezile hamwe na weye, segeleni kuhakunguzuka.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ivo Daudi na wanhu wake walamka chilochilo kubwela kuna iisi ya Wafilisiti. Nawo Wafilisiti wahita Yezileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowananga Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Daudi na wanhu wake viwafikile Zikilagi siku yeketatu, Waamaleki wakala waitowa isi ya Negebu na Zikilagi. Waditowa bululu da Zikilagi na kuditimbula kwa moto, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />na wawasola wanaake wakalile umo, wakulu kwa wadodo, hawawakomile mbali wahita nawo.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na wanhu wake viwafikile Zikilagi, wafika bululu ditimbuligwa, wake zawo na wana wawo wa chilume na wana wawo wa chike wasoligwa mateka. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Daudi na wanhu wakalile hamwe nayo, walandula madizi yawo walila kwa usungu mbaka wamalilwa nguvu ya kulila kaidi. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Iviya wake waidi wa Daudi wasoligwa mateka, Ahinoamu wa Yezileeli na Abigaili, mgane wa Nabali wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Daudi kakala na lugano mkulu kwaviya walonga wolonda kumtowa na mabwe. Chila munhu kakala na usungu muna umoyo wake kwa ichimu cha kwagilwa na wanage wa chilume na wachike. Mbali Daudi kaigangamiza kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wake.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Maabaho Daudi kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko Abiasali mwana wa Ahimeleki, “Nigalile chizibawo.” Nayo Abiasali kamgalila. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daudi kamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vino niwasondelele wanhu waja waditimbule bululu jetu? Vino nodaha kuwapata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Wasondelele. Kweli kwizawapata na kwizawakombola wasoligwe.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Daudi hamwe na wanhu waja magana sita, wafika kuna dikolongo da Besoli, hanhu baho wanhu wamwenga walekigwa kuchisogo. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Daudi na wanhu wake magana mane wagendelela kusondelela, mbali wanhu magana maidi wasigala kuchisogo kwaviya walegela ng'hani mbaka wapotigwa kuloka chizanda cha Besoli.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Wamfika Mmisili kuichuwala, wamgala kwa Daudi. Wamwing'ha gate na mazi ya kung'wa. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Maabaho wamwing'ha chibuluga cha nhini na vipambo vidi va zabibu zinyalile. Kaja na kapata nguvu, kwaviya kakala hanakuja chinhu chochose hebu kung'wa mazi kwa siku nhatu.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi kamuuza, “Mwenevale wako yelihi na kolawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Nayo kamwidika, “Niye Mmisili, msang'hani wa Mwamaleki. Mwenevale wangu kanileka kuchisogo kwaviya nikala mtamu siku nhatu zifosile. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Chiwatowa wanhu wa isi ya Negebu ya Wakelesi na isi ya Yuda na Negebu ya Kalebu. Bululu da Zikilagi chiditimbula kwa moto.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi kamuuza, “Vino weye kodaha kunigala kwa Waamaleki waja?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Nayo kamwidika, “One uhanilahila kwa Mulungu kuwa hwizanikoma hebu kuniguma muna yamakono ya mwenevale wangu, nizakugala.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Kamgala Daudi mbaka hanhu howakalile Waameleki, nawo wakala wapwililika chila hanhu kwaviya wakala woja na kung'wa na kutenda dugila, kwa ichimu cha vinhu vingi viwasolile kulawa muna iisi ya Wafilisiti na isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi kaitowa nawo kwandusila imitondo mbaka ichigulogulo, habule mulume yadahile kwiibanga, mbali wabwanga magana mane wowakwelile ngamiya na kuibanga. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi kabweleza chila chinhu chiwasolile Waamaleki, hamwe na wake zake waidi. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Habule chinhu chagile, mdodo hebu mkulu, mwana wa chilume hebu wa chike hebu mateka hebu chila chinhu chiwasolile, Daudi kavibweleza vose. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Iviya Daudi kasola mabumbila yose ya ng'hondolo na ng'ombe, wanhu wake wowawalongoze kuulongozi wa wanyama wamwenga, walonga, “Wanyama wano Daudi kawahoka kuna ing'hondo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Maabaho Daudi kawafikila wanhu waja magana maidi wowakalile wolonda kusinduka mbaka wapotigwa kumsondelela Daudi, waja wawalekile wakale habehi na chizanda cha Besoli. Nawo walawa kunze muladi kuwahokela Daudi na wanhu waja wakalile hamwe nayo. Daudi viyawakwenhukile wanhu wawo kawalamsa. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Mbali wanhu wotenda yehile na watatali mwa wanhu wa Daudi, walonga, “Kwaviya hawahitile hamwe na cheye, hachizaweng'ha chinhu chochose chochisolile kulawa kwa Waameleki, mbali chila munhu kezakwing'higwa muke wake na wanage. Wawasole, wasegele.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi kedika, “Siivo bule ndugu zangu, hamudaha kutenda ivo kwa chiya Mndewa Mulungu choyachipatile. Yeye kachikaliza na kadika muna yamakono yetu bumbila diya dikalile doitowa na cheye. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Vino yelihi yondayategeleze mbuli zomulonga? Waja wasigale na vinhu vetu wezakwing'higwa sawa na waja wahitile kuna ing'hondo. Wose wezagoliligwa sawa.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Daudi kaitenda mbuli iyo iwe lagilizo na ndagilizi kwa Waisilaili, kwandusila siku iyo mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi viyafikile Zikilagi, katuma vinhu vimwenga viyasolile kwa walala wa Yuda, kalonga, “Loleni, chitumetume chenu kulawa muna ivinhu va wehi wa Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Vinhu ivo kawatuma walala waja wakalile Beseli na Lamosi Negebu na Yatili <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na Aloeli na Sifimosi na Eshitemoa <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na Lakali na kwa walala wa mabululu ya Wayelameeli na mabululu ya Wakeni <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na kwa walala wa Holima na kwa walala wa Boli Ashani na kwa walala wa Asaki <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na kwa walala wa Hebuloni. Iviya Daudi kawatuma vinhu kwa walala wa mabululu yose koyahitile yeye na wanhu wake.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Sauli na wanage wa chilume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Wafilisiti waitowa ng'hondo na Isilaili, Waisilaili wawakimbila Wafilisiti, wengi wakomigwa kuna umulima wa Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Wafilisiti wamsondelela ng'hani Sauli na wanage wa chilume, wawakoma Yonasani na Abinadabu na Malikishua weli wana wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ng'hondo ikala ng'hulu ng'hani kwa Sauli, wapigisaji wa misale wamguma nhale Sauli na wamulumiza ng'hani.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sauli kamulongela mpagazi ija wa via vake va ng'hondo, “Somola zele jako unikome, muladi sekenidunhunzigwe na sekenikomigwe na wanhu wano hawagumigwe ulungwana.” Mbali munhu iyo kalema, kwaviya kadumba ng'hani. Ivo Sauli kadilava zele jake na kadigwila na dimkoma. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Munhu iyo viyawonile kuwa Sauli kadanganika, nayo iviya kadigwila zele jake na kaikoma hamwe na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ivo Sauli na wanage watatu na mpagazi wa via va ng'hondo na wanhu wake wose, wadanganika hamwe siku iyo iyo.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Waisilaili wakalile ubanzi umwenga wa bawe diya na kuumwambu wa Yoludani, viwawonile watowang'hondo wa Isilaili wakimbila na iviya Sauli na wanage wadanganika, wayaleka mabululu yawo na wakimbila. Wafilisiti wahita na wakala umo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Igolo yake Wafilisiti viwahitile kuhoka mitufi ija, wamfika Sauli na wanage watatu wagwa muna umulima wa Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Wamdumula Sauli iditwi na wamuhoka via vake va ng'hondo na watuma usenga muna iisi yose ya Wafilisiti kugong'onda mbuli iyo muna ikaye ya nyang'hiti za milungu na kwa wanhu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Weka via va ng'hondo va Sauli muna ikaye ya milungu Maashitalosi na wautumbika mtufi wake muna ing'huta ya bululu da Besi Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Wanhu wa Yabeshi Gileadi viwahulike chiya Wafilisiti chiwamtendele Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />watowang'hondo magalu wose wahita ichilo chose mbaka Besi Shani. Waisola mtufi ya Sauli na mitufi ya wanage, waisegeza muna ing'huta ya bululu da Besi Shani na waigala Yabeshi, uko waitimbula. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Maabaho wasola mavuha yawo na wayawanda hasi ya mbiki wa mkwazu uko Yabeshi na hawadile kwa siku saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>